(513660, 50830, 14593, '<td valign="top">beautiful photograph, but I''m not so sure I like all the color added to it.....I''m not trying to be critical because I think the composition of the photo and the subject is wonderful.  The color just does not appeal to my eye.  I am giving it a higher score tho...</td>', 'beautiful photograph, but I''m not so sure I like all the color added to it.....I''m not trying to be critical because I think the composition of the photo and the subject is wonderful.  The color just does not appeal to my eye.  I am giving it a higher score tho...', '2003-12-15 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(513662, 50668, 7703, '<td valign="top">There is no woww in this picture. Ok, you do what the challenge tell. Take picture of water, but this is not enough for me.</td>', 'There is no woww in this picture. Ok, you do what the challenge tell. Take picture of water, but this is not enough for me.', '2003-12-15 10:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
