(513665, 50901, 14593, '<td valign="top">I tried to capture frozen ice in my photo submission too, and I found it wasn''t as easy as it looked.....your effort is very nice!!</td>', 'I tried to capture frozen ice in my photo submission too, and I found it wasn''t as easy as it looked.....your effort is very nice!!', '2003-12-15 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
