(513966, 50798, 2612, '<td valign="top">The water could make an excellent backgound for this shot, but I don''t think you need to show so much. Move in closer to the subject, the water will still be easily recognizable in the background. Some more light would be also be helpful, maybe from a different time of day or fill flash. On the positive side, foxus is good and exposure was perfect for keeping the orchid in focus but blurring the water.</td>', 'The water could make an excellent backgound for this shot, but I don''t think you need to show so much. Move in closer to the subject, the water will still be easily recognizable in the background. Some more light would be also be helpful, maybe from a different time of day or fill flash. On the positive side, foxus is good and exposure was perfect for keeping the orchid in focus but blurring the water.', '2003-12-15 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
