(514092, 50611, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture. Excellent exposure time. Just one problem is the cropping out of the top of the bush in the upper right. I think I would have liked it better if you cropped the picture just above the rock on the right at the base of the bush. 8</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture. Excellent exposure time. Just one problem is the cropping out of the top of the bush in the upper right. I think I would have liked it better if you cropped the picture just above the rock on the right at the base of the bush. 8', '2003-12-15 22:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(514093, 50087, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very smooth. I like it.</td>', 'Very smooth. I like it.', '2003-12-15 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(514094, 50852, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the colors. Excellent set up. One of my favorites</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the colors. Excellent set up. One of my favorites', '2003-12-15 22:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(514095, 50832, 3306, '<td valign="top">nice reflection. I like the symmetry and colors.</td>', 'nice reflection. I like the symmetry and colors.', '2003-12-15 22:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514100, 50179, 10978, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, I get chills just looking at it.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, I get chills just looking at it.', '2003-12-15 22:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(514102, 50872, 10978, '<td valign="top">Looks like a winner to me. How nice it must be to have a place like this to enjoy.....10</td>', 'Looks like a winner to me. How nice it must be to have a place like this to enjoy.....10', '2003-12-15 22:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(514110, 50725, 10978, '<td valign="top">This was a great idea. One of the best in this challenge...good luck! .....9</td>', 'This was a great idea. One of the best in this challenge...good luck! .....9', '2003-12-15 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(514115, 50830, 10978, '<td valign="top">To bad about the blue tint, not a good choice for this shot.</td>', 'To bad about the blue tint, not a good choice for this shot.', '2003-12-15 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(514121, 50541, 5792, '<td valign="top">Frozen blue berries are a major treat.</td>', 'Frozen blue berries are a major treat.', '2003-12-15 22:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514126, 50400, 8125, '<td valign="top">Technically - a terrific shot: lighting is right on, composition and dof are excellent.  Meets the challenge well and is an original idea.  Overall - excellent!  :-)</td>', 'Technically - a terrific shot: lighting is right on, composition and dof are excellent.  Meets the challenge well and is an original idea.  Overall - excellent!  :-)', '2003-12-15 22:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(514127, 50496, 8125, '<td valign="top">Original idea.  Lighting: good, Composition: good, Excellent capture of the water drops.</td>', 'Original idea.  Lighting: good, Composition: good, Excellent capture of the water drops.', '2003-12-15 22:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(514128, 50661, 8125, '<td valign="top">Looks like a neat place.  Seems to be out of focus a bit.  I like the color tone you used.</td>', 'Looks like a neat place.  Seems to be out of focus a bit.  I like the color tone you used.', '2003-12-15 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(514129, 50619, 8125, '<td valign="top">The right 1/3 of the image is suffering from too much light.</td>', 'The right 1/3 of the image is suffering from too much light.', '2003-12-15 22:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(514130, 50660, 772, '<td valign="top">best in show.</td>', 'best in show.', '2003-12-15 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(514131, 50797, 8125, '<td valign="top">Neat idea... an interesting effect.   Nice job.  :-)</td>', 'Neat idea... an interesting effect.   Nice job.  :-)', '2003-12-15 22:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(514135, 50611, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fluffy effect on the water, and great detail in the rocks and grasses. I like the thin grass at the base. This must have been a really long exposure to get that effect on the water.</td>', 'Beautiful fluffy effect on the water, and great detail in the rocks and grasses. I like the thin grass at the base. This must have been a really long exposure to get that effect on the water.', '2003-12-15 23:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(514147, 50889, 6504, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2003-12-16 00:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(514168, 50300, 5534, '<td valign="top">Intresting and creative shot. Like the use of black and white here. 7</td>', 'Intresting and creative shot. Like the use of black and white here. 7', '2003-12-16 01:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(514171, 50890, 5534, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting. Like how you have that one droplet hanging. 8</td>', 'Excellent lighting. Like how you have that one droplet hanging. 8', '2003-12-16 01:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(514173, 50737, 9387, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photo.  It could also have won the simplicity challenge.  This is a very strong photo.  The colors are right on, the red really catches the eye and the water looks like I could reach out and get some in my hand.  The composition is exceptional.  I give this photo a 10+.  When I saw this as a thumbnail I knew it was going to be great.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'I absolutely love this photo.  It could also have won the simplicity challenge.  This is a very strong photo.  The colors are right on, the red really catches the eye and the water looks like I could reach out and get some in my hand.  The composition is exceptional.  I give this photo a 10+.  When I saw this as a thumbnail I knew it was going to be great.  Wonderful job!', '2003-12-16 01:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(514195, 50895, 9251, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2003-12-16 02:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(514199, 50709, 9251, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot!</td>', 'Perfect shot!', '2003-12-16 02:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(514200, 50884, 12802, '<td valign="top">It is a great shot, good details in the eye of the swan, but the water in the background isn''t really the most dominating piece of this photo. [7]</td>', 'It is a great shot, good details in the eye of the swan, but the water in the background isn''t really the most dominating piece of this photo. [7]', '2003-12-16 02:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514201, 50555, 9251, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo..I love the mist rising off the water..</td>', 'Wonderful photo..I love the mist rising off the water..', '2003-12-16 02:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(514204, 50042, 5534, '<td valign="top">The glob of snow on the left looks a bit overexposed. 5</td>', 'The glob of snow on the left looks a bit overexposed. 5', '2003-12-16 03:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(514205, 50670, 5534, '<td valign="top">Like how the ripples on the water add to this photograph. 6</td>', 'Like how the ripples on the water add to this photograph. 6', '2003-12-16 03:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(514206, 50903, 5534, '<td valign="top">Great textures. They really help the photograph.</td>', 'Great textures. They really help the photograph.', '2003-12-16 03:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(514210, 50625, 12802, '<td valign="top">I think there are two ways to do a photo like this, a long exposure to make the water look like silk or how you have done it with a short exposure to capture the water droplets.<br/> <br/>I do think you have pulled this off well, but a faster shutter speed would have been good to get the water droplets really still.  <br/> <br/>In all, a good photo, nice DOF to get detail in from the front to the back. [7]</td>', 'I think there are two ways to do a photo like this, a long exposure to make the water look like silk or how you have done it with a short exposure to capture the water droplets. I do think you have pulled this off well, but a faster shutter speed would have been good to get the water droplets really still.   In all, a good photo, nice DOF to get detail in from the front to the back. [7]', '2003-12-16 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(514211, 50744, 12802, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this shot a while as I''m not sure what I would have liked to change on it.<br/> <br/>It''s a great shot of the water and ice, the ripples in the water are nicely captured.<br/> <br/>Maybe I would have liked to have seen more of the area?  <br/> <br/>A good shot [8]</td>', 'I have looked at this shot a while as I''m not sure what I would have liked to change on it. It''s a great shot of the water and ice, the ripples in the water are nicely captured. Maybe I would have liked to have seen more of the area?   A good shot [8]', '2003-12-16 03:28:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(514214, 50690, 12802, '<td valign="top">Is there water in these bottles?<br/> <br/>The shot seems a little dark to me at the bottom, maybe is you had used a torch(??) to light the bottom area just enough to make the outlines out.<br/> <br/>I nice picture!</td>', 'Is there water in these bottles? The shot seems a little dark to me at the bottom, maybe is you had used a torch(??) to light the bottom area just enough to make the outlines out. I nice picture!', '2003-12-16 03:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(514218, 50567, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like long exposure shots like this, however I think yours could have benefited from a longer exposure.  The water at the bottom doesn''t look smooth enough for a good long exposure.  I''ll have to nip off a point or two for that.<br/> <br/>I still love the photo, you can see a few long exposure ones in my portfolio. [8]</td>', 'I really like long exposure shots like this, however I think yours could have benefited from a longer exposure.  The water at the bottom doesn''t look smooth enough for a good long exposure.  I''ll have to nip off a point or two for that. I still love the photo, you can see a few long exposure ones in my portfolio. [8]', '2003-12-16 03:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(514222, 50520, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, good lighting, fits the challenge well, good DOF...  need I say more, unfortunately I will...<br/> <br/>You could have used the clone tool here to take the small imperfection out of the water droplet, plus the little line next to the reflection in the water.  This, to me, would have made this an amazing shot.  Due to this I''m afraid I''ll have to drop you down a point.  Sorry [9]</td>', 'Excellent shot, good lighting, fits the challenge well, good DOF...  need I say more, unfortunately I will... You could have used the clone tool here to take the small imperfection out of the water droplet, plus the little line next to the reflection in the water.  This, to me, would have made this an amazing shot.  Due to this I''m afraid I''ll have to drop you down a point.  Sorry [9]', '2003-12-16 03:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(514223, 50611, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-) I love long exposure shots, I''m glad that there have been a few in this challenge and I feel yours is one of the better ones.<br/> <br/>You''ve got the right exposure time here to make the water look nice and silky, there''s loads of details in the rocks around.  Well done!  [10]</td>', ':-) I love long exposure shots, I''m glad that there have been a few in this challenge and I feel yours is one of the better ones. You''ve got the right exposure time here to make the water look nice and silky, there''s loads of details in the rocks around.  Well done!  [10]', '2003-12-16 03:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(514224, 50898, 12802, '<td valign="top">NIce purple look here, a great shot. <br/> <br/>A touch sharper would have gotten full marks!  [9]</td>', 'NIce purple look here, a great shot.  A touch sharper would have gotten full marks!  [9]', '2003-12-16 03:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(514225, 50813, 12802, '<td valign="top">A nice shot here, maybe a touch sharper would have brought out more detail though.<br/> <br/>You could have used the clone tool to your advantave though...  The marks in the water at the bottom of the picture and you have a hot spot on the right hand side, in the middle of the shot.  [8]</td>', 'A nice shot here, maybe a touch sharper would have brought out more detail though. You could have used the clone tool to your advantave though...  The marks in the water at the bottom of the picture and you have a hot spot on the right hand side, in the middle of the shot.  [8]', '2003-12-16 03:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(514226, 50797, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, it''s like one of those pictures that if you stare at it too long your eyes go weird!  <br/> <br/>I really like this!!  Full marks! [10]</td>', 'This is a great shot, it''s like one of those pictures that if you stare at it too long your eyes go weird!   I really like this!!  Full marks! [10]', '2003-12-16 03:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(514227, 50850, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, a touch sharper would have brought out the detail on the front droplet.  [8]</td>', 'I like this shot, a touch sharper would have brought out the detail on the front droplet.  [8]', '2003-12-16 03:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(514229, 50520, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful, I love the blue, to me it says "water". the clarity of the water drop is great and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'This is very beautiful, I love the blue, to me it says "water". the clarity of the water drop is great and the lighting is perfect.', '2003-12-16 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(514230, 50798, 12802, '<td valign="top">I think you could maybe have made this better by using a longer exposure and a  higher F Stop.  The water in the background would have looked like silk and with a higher F Stop more light would have been used for the picture.<br/> <br/>I do like this shot though, honest!  [7]</td>', 'I think you could maybe have made this better by using a longer exposure and a  higher F Stop.  The water in the background would have looked like silk and with a higher F Stop more light would have been used for the picture. I do like this shot though, honest!  [7]', '2003-12-16 04:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(514233, 50860, 12802, '<td valign="top">Hmmm......   I can see how this relaters to water, but it''s difficult to see the water.<br/> <br/>I think the border or post-shot manipulation you have done spoils this shot.  [5]<br/></td>', 'Hmmm......   I can see how this relaters to water, but it''s difficult to see the water. I think the border or post-shot manipulation you have done spoils this shot.  [5]', '2003-12-16 04:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(514239, 50674, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but to improve maybe make your exposure longer to make the water look silky.<br/> <br/>Still a good photo, good DOF to get all the detail in.  [8]</td>', 'I like this shot, but to improve maybe make your exposure longer to make the water look silky. Still a good photo, good DOF to get all the detail in.  [8]', '2003-12-16 04:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(514240, 50845, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good long exposure to make the water look silky.  [9]</td>', 'Very nice, good long exposure to make the water look silky.  [9]', '2003-12-16 04:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(514241, 50888, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-) Wrong challenge, this would have done well in the Simplicity one too!  <br/> <br/>Well done, a very nice and clear shot.  Maybe you could have used the clone tool to remove the reflections from the droplet?  [10]</td>', ':-) Wrong challenge, this would have done well in the Simplicity one too!   Well done, a very nice and clear shot.  Maybe you could have used the clone tool to remove the reflections from the droplet?  [10]', '2003-12-16 04:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(514243, 50880, 12802, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, like all the bubbles.  Seems a little dark in the top left hand corner (Most probably my monitor though!) [8]</td>', 'Cool shot, like all the bubbles.  Seems a little dark in the top left hand corner (Most probably my monitor though!) [8]', '2003-12-16 05:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(514244, 50574, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-)  Good shot.  Seems a little overexposed though? [7]</td>', ':-)  Good shot.  Seems a little overexposed though? [7]', '2003-12-16 05:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(514246, 50470, 12802, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, nice and calm (Could have been used for the Simplicity shot!) [10]</td>', 'A beautiful shot, nice and calm (Could have been used for the Simplicity shot!) [10]', '2003-12-16 05:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(514247, 50631, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice fast shutter speed to capture the waves and water jumping upwards.  Beautiful skyline.  Well Done! [10]</td>', 'Nice fast shutter speed to capture the waves and water jumping upwards.  Beautiful skyline.  Well Done! [10]', '2003-12-16 05:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(514256, 50690, 5534, '<td valign="top">I think the colors here really make this a stronger photo, without it would be a plain image. 7</td>', 'I think the colors here really make this a stronger photo, without it would be a plain image. 7', '2003-12-16 05:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(514259, 50709, 5534, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice use of a slower shutter speed. Only complaint is the graininess of the greenish blue water. 7</td>', 'Great colors, nice use of a slower shutter speed. Only complaint is the graininess of the greenish blue water. 7', '2003-12-16 05:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(514260, 50737, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, it''s clear, well photographed and the red colour around the top of the just is nice anc vibrant.  <br/> <br/>The only thing that I don''t really like about the shot it the border. If it was just black then maybe it would have been better, but the white line down it distracts my eye.  If it had been in the centre of the black border it''d have been better.  Have to drop a point for this i''m afraid. [9]</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, it''s clear, well photographed and the red colour around the top of the just is nice anc vibrant.   The only thing that I don''t really like about the shot it the border. If it was just black then maybe it would have been better, but the white line down it distracts my eye.  If it had been in the centre of the black border it''d have been better.  Have to drop a point for this i''m afraid. [9]', '2003-12-16 05:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(514261, 50879, 5534, '<td valign="top">I think if you cropped out more off the top it would''ve helped.</td>', 'I think if you cropped out more off the top it would''ve helped.', '2003-12-16 05:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(514264, 50048, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good capture of the water.  [10]</td>', 'Very nice, good capture of the water.  [10]', '2003-12-16 05:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(514265, 50818, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good lighting used to make a cool purple / reddy effect!  [9]</td>', 'Very nice shot, good lighting used to make a cool purple / reddy effect!  [9]', '2003-12-16 05:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(514266, 50870, 12802, '<td valign="top">Thanks, you''ve got that song stuck in my head now.....<br/> <br/>A great shot, the dark water, the white snow!!!  I''d lov to be there on Christmas day!<br/> <br/>Good DOF, nice and clear all over the picture.  The only thing I would say is to use the clone tool to your advantage.  The little pice of snow in the water on the front right hand side of the river bank could have been removed. (Well, I think it''s snow...)<br/> <br/>In all, a good, clear and Christmassy photograph!  Full marks! [10]</td>', 'Thanks, you''ve got that song stuck in my head now..... A great shot, the dark water, the white snow!!!  I''d lov to be there on Christmas day! Good DOF, nice and clear all over the picture.  The only thing I would say is to use the clone tool to your advantage.  The little pice of snow in the water on the front right hand side of the river bank could have been removed. (Well, I think it''s snow...) In all, a good, clear and Christmassy photograph!  Full marks! [10]', '2003-12-16 05:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514267, 50833, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-) A very good photograph here.  The blue effect around makes it better, gives it a cold feel.  I like how you waited till the ice cube had melted before taking the picture.  [9]</td>', ':-) A very good photograph here.  The blue effect around makes it better, gives it a cold feel.  I like how you waited till the ice cube had melted before taking the picture.  [9]', '2003-12-16 05:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(514270, 50704, 12802, '<td valign="top">This could be a stem off a wine glass!  <br/> <br/>A very godd shot!  Nice and clear shot.  <br/> <br/>Did you have on a greenish jumper and orange (or red) trousers?  [9]</td>', 'This could be a stem off a wine glass!   A very godd shot!  Nice and clear shot.   Did you have on a greenish jumper and orange (or red) trousers?  [9]', '2003-12-16 05:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(514272, 50660, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome still life, the color tones are amazing. (10)</td>', 'Awesome still life, the color tones are amazing. (10)', '2003-12-16 06:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(514296, 50734, 13905, '<td valign="top">too much digital editing i think...</td>', 'too much digital editing i think...', '2003-12-16 06:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(514299, 50745, 13905, '<td valign="top">OuT Of FoCus...</td>', 'OuT Of FoCus...', '2003-12-16 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(514323, 50852, 11897, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, should go close for me. 10</td>', 'Beautiful colours, should go close for me. 10', '2003-12-16 07:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(514324, 50660, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great detail. 10</td>', 'Great detail. 10', '2003-12-16 07:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(514326, 50354, 10809, '<td valign="top">great photo, shame it''s a little grainy.</td>', 'great photo, shame it''s a little grainy.', '2003-12-16 07:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(514327, 50400, 11897, '<td valign="top">My pick of two for the top slot. Great lighting. 10</td>', 'My pick of two for the top slot. Great lighting. 10', '2003-12-16 07:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(514328, 50709, 11897, '<td valign="top">Well captured, one of my picks for the top two, 10</td>', 'Well captured, one of my picks for the top two, 10', '2003-12-16 07:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(514330, 50065, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great shot. 9</td>', 'Great shot. 9', '2003-12-16 07:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(514331, 50852, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great contrasting of colors. They work very well with each other. Focusing is excellent. Would like more emphasize on the water droplets. They almost blend into the petals. The highlights on the droplets aren''t enough to help them pop out of the shot.</td>', 'Great contrasting of colors. They work very well with each other. Focusing is excellent. Would like more emphasize on the water droplets. They almost blend into the petals. The highlights on the droplets aren''t enough to help them pop out of the shot.', '2003-12-16 08:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(514332, 50867, 10084, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell that the water is going down without the title. Maybe showing more of the bottom part of the composition would help give that feeling. There''s no reference point for the ground.</td>', 'Can''t really tell that the water is going down without the title. Maybe showing more of the bottom part of the composition would help give that feeling. There''s no reference point for the ground.', '2003-12-16 08:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(514333, 50704, 10809, '<td valign="top">very clever!</td>', 'very clever!', '2003-12-16 08:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(514334, 50900, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field. Focusing is very good. I think a bit more light would help the droplets pop out more. They don''t have enough highlights. The diagonal composition helps to keep the composition interesting.</td>', 'Great depth of field. Focusing is very good. I think a bit more light would help the droplets pop out more. They don''t have enough highlights. The diagonal composition helps to keep the composition interesting.', '2003-12-16 08:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(514338, 50378, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and crisp shot. The composition is very interesting with the turtle swimming upwards.Lighting was captured very well. Almost like a spotlight on the turtle. Wished that the fishes in the background was blur a tiny bit because to help emphasize the turtle.</td>', 'Very sharp and crisp shot. The composition is very interesting with the turtle swimming upwards.Lighting was captured very well. Almost like a spotlight on the turtle. Wished that the fishes in the background was blur a tiny bit because to help emphasize the turtle.', '2003-12-16 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(514340, 50904, 10084, '<td valign="top">Vertical composition helps to give interest to the shot. It would be nice to have the shower head a bit sharper.</td>', 'Vertical composition helps to give interest to the shot. It would be nice to have the shower head a bit sharper.', '2003-12-16 08:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(514341, 50473, 10084, '<td valign="top">Diagonal composition of the cup and the orange gives great interest to the shot. It leads your eyes from the orange down along the cup and then back up toward the water splashing. I think that the lighting coming from the top left is distracting to the picture.</td>', 'Diagonal composition of the cup and the orange gives great interest to the shot. It leads your eyes from the orange down along the cup and then back up toward the water splashing. I think that the lighting coming from the top left is distracting to the picture.', '2003-12-16 08:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(514356, 50690, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting soft focus lighting on the subjects.The bottom of the composition seems to be too dark. Would like to see more of the beautiful curves in the bottles.</td>', 'Interesting soft focus lighting on the subjects.The bottom of the composition seems to be too dark. Would like to see more of the beautiful curves in the bottles.', '2003-12-16 08:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(514358, 50545, 10084, '<td valign="top">Vertical shot gives good interest to the composition. I believe taking some of the bottom part out may help enhance the interest a bit more. The colors of the sky are absolutely beautiful, great hues of blue captured. Highlights in the water are also very nicely captured.</td>', 'Vertical shot gives good interest to the composition. I believe taking some of the bottom part out may help enhance the interest a bit more. The colors of the sky are absolutely beautiful, great hues of blue captured. Highlights in the water are also very nicely captured.', '2003-12-16 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(514360, 50839, 10084, '<td valign="top">The goldfish blends in with the background a little too much. If it wasn''t for the great contrast in the shadow I would almost have missed it. I believed you could have blurred out the background with a gaussian blur and still be within the December rules.</td>', 'The goldfish blends in with the background a little too much. If it wasn''t for the great contrast in the shadow I would almost have missed it. I believed you could have blurred out the background with a gaussian blur and still be within the December rules.', '2003-12-16 08:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(514361, 50905, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great hightlights in the water help to make it pop out of the shot. Blue background frames the droplets very nicely. I wished that the dark part of the background was perfectily horizontal, in it''s current position it distracts.</td>', 'Great hightlights in the water help to make it pop out of the shot. Blue background frames the droplets very nicely. I wished that the dark part of the background was perfectily horizontal, in it''s current position it distracts.', '2003-12-16 08:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514362, 50179, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great winter water flow shot. Composition is very nice unfortunately the limb that goes diagonal across the picture distracts and hides the main part of the waterfall. It does have the icicles that makes it interesting. I think a white frame would help enhance this shot.</td>', 'Great winter water flow shot. Composition is very nice unfortunately the limb that goes diagonal across the picture distracts and hides the main part of the waterfall. It does have the icicles that makes it interesting. I think a white frame would help enhance this shot.', '2003-12-16 08:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(514377, 50829, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting soft focus study. The great curves of the bottle keeps the composition interesting. Pull the bottle further back from the background would have eliminated the distracting shadow.</td>', 'Very interesting soft focus study. The great curves of the bottle keeps the composition interesting. Pull the bottle further back from the background would have eliminated the distracting shadow.', '2003-12-16 09:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(514385, 50527, 3724, '<td valign="top">Thoughtful and really good subject matter - an extra credit for that.  Iiridescent qualities are always interesting and  beautiful, but the oil slick itself is sinister and deadly for wild life and birds.  Whenever I see an image like this it triggers other thoughts of peacock feathers or Sammy Davis Jr in a tailored Italian suit.</td>', 'Thoughtful and really good subject matter - an extra credit for that.  Iiridescent qualities are always interesting and  beautiful, but the oil slick itself is sinister and deadly for wild life and birds.  Whenever I see an image like this it triggers other thoughts of peacock feathers or Sammy Davis Jr in a tailored Italian suit.', '2003-12-16 09:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(514388, 50818, 3724, '<td valign="top">.....beautiful abstract - I enjoy the dimension of the boiling liquid on this colour field of gas burner red-orange, yellow and blue.</td>', '.....beautiful abstract - I enjoy the dimension of the boiling liquid on this colour field of gas burner red-orange, yellow and blue.', '2003-12-16 09:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(514399, 50878, 3724, '<td valign="top">grey and blue make a soft colour scheme easy on the eye.  The action and movement of the water adds interesting environ for the  projecting blue star with the simple sharp focused water drops.</td>', 'grey and blue make a soft colour scheme easy on the eye.  The action and movement of the water adds interesting environ for the  projecting blue star with the simple sharp focused water drops.', '2003-12-16 09:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
