(514514, 50265, 14715, '<td valign="top">I like the way you present the ''waterfall'' them as seen from someone in the city.  Must have been coming down pretty hard.</td>', 'I like the way you present the ''waterfall'' them as seen from someone in the city.  Must have been coming down pretty hard.', '2003-12-16 12:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(514517, 50816, 14715, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors..  Great abstract of water.  10</td>', 'Stunning colors..  Great abstract of water.  10', '2003-12-16 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(514536, 50896, 7033, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, with fantastic lighting.  The strong diagonal created by the stream works well to draw my eye across the shot, and the arching trees add to the interest of the shot.  The colors are a bit too over-saturated, however, and detract significantly from the overall effect of your shot, in my opinion. --7</td>', 'Beautiful scene, with fantastic lighting.  The strong diagonal created by the stream works well to draw my eye across the shot, and the arching trees add to the interest of the shot.  The colors are a bit too over-saturated, however, and detract significantly from the overall effect of your shot, in my opinion. --7', '2003-12-16 13:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(514537, 50709, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very good use of a longer shutter speed... the pastel colors from the underwater lighting create an almost mystical effect within the shot.</td>', 'Very good use of a longer shutter speed... the pastel colors from the underwater lighting create an almost mystical effect within the shot.', '2003-12-16 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(514541, 50520, 7033, '<td valign="top">I love the combined effect of the shallow DOF and rich colors combined with this low-key shot.  If it were mine, I might have tried bringing the water droplet to thirds, or to a fully centered position-- perhaps even cropping a bit off the bottom of the shot to do so.  --8</td>', 'I love the combined effect of the shallow DOF and rich colors combined with this low-key shot.  If it were mine, I might have tried bringing the water droplet to thirds, or to a fully centered position-- perhaps even cropping a bit off the bottom of the shot to do so.  --8', '2003-12-16 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(514550, 50864, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured... I can almost hear the sound of the "bloop"!  While the shallow DOF works well, there appears to be some after-effects of perhaps a bit of overprocessing in the lighter areas behind the ''bloop''.  In my opinion, it detracts from the overall impact of your shot.</td>', 'Very nicely captured... I can almost hear the sound of the "bloop"!  While the shallow DOF works well, there appears to be some after-effects of perhaps a bit of overprocessing in the lighter areas behind the ''bloop''.  In my opinion, it detracts from the overall impact of your shot.', '2003-12-16 13:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(514553, 50409, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a beautiful scene... the tone and saturation are just right.</td>', 'Nice capture of a beautiful scene... the tone and saturation are just right.', '2003-12-16 13:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
