(514643, 50849, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors. A great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors. A great shot.', '2003-12-16 16:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(514649, 50561, 12733, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that this is a picture of the red ball dropping into the glass of water that was turned 180 degrees after being taken. As shown, it seems to be impossible - why isn''t the water running out and why is the red ball staying at the bottom? An interesting picture.</td>', 'I get the feeling that this is a picture of the red ball dropping into the glass of water that was turned 180 degrees after being taken. As shown, it seems to be impossible - why isn''t the water running out and why is the red ball staying at the bottom? An interesting picture.', '2003-12-16 16:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514651, 50473, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is that really a splash, or does the fact that so little of the glass is shown indicate that something is happening outside the picture. The droplets are interesting but, I think, confusing. To my eye it seems to realistic to be a great abstract, but too abstract to be a really great realistic shot despite the brilliant colors and composition.</td>', 'Is that really a splash, or does the fact that so little of the glass is shown indicate that something is happening outside the picture. The droplets are interesting but, I think, confusing. To my eye it seems to realistic to be a great abstract, but too abstract to be a really great realistic shot despite the brilliant colors and composition.', '2003-12-16 16:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(514652, 50870, 5534, '<td valign="top">Beautiful snow landscape. Makes me wish we had snow in Hawaii.</td>', 'Beautiful snow landscape. Makes me wish we had snow in Hawaii.', '2003-12-16 16:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(514655, 50808, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute pun. Were the trees like this naturally, or did you move something to create the effect (seems like it had to be natural unless you swam out there). Black and white is a good choice.</td>', 'Cute pun. Were the trees like this naturally, or did you move something to create the effect (seems like it had to be natural unless you swam out there). Black and white is a good choice.', '2003-12-16 16:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(514659, 50813, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures. Without the people, it would seem like a closeup of small grasses. By including them you both add interest (a little story) and create the scale needed to appreciate the size of the foliage.</td>', 'Great colors and textures. Without the people, it would seem like a closeup of small grasses. By including them you both add interest (a little story) and create the scale needed to appreciate the size of the foliage.', '2003-12-16 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(514662, 50545, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great patterns on the water, and a beautiful sky. The people add a focal point that leads into the picture. Where I am, north of New York City, there''s a foot of snow on the ground. Where was this taken?</td>', 'Great patterns on the water, and a beautiful sky. The people add a focal point that leads into the picture. Where I am, north of New York City, there''s a foot of snow on the ground. Where was this taken?', '2003-12-16 16:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514666, 50400, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the machine parts. Black and white is a good choice for this shot. I''m not sure the water droplets add anything more than a justification for using this shot in this challenge.</td>', 'Great detail on the machine parts. Black and white is a good choice for this shot. I''m not sure the water droplets add anything more than a justification for using this shot in this challenge.', '2003-12-16 16:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(514668, 50872, 14401, '<td valign="top">What can I say?  Wow!  10</td>', 'What can I say?  Wow!  10', '2003-12-16 16:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(514669, 50863, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, and a tricky use of falling water. The space above the stream of water is a bit puzzling; it seems the water is not pouring from above the picture.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, and a tricky use of falling water. The space above the stream of water is a bit puzzling; it seems the water is not pouring from above the picture.', '2003-12-16 16:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(514672, 50892, 12733, '<td valign="top">Ice crystal? Snowflake? Whatever, it is really a beautiful shape and the way you''ve captured the glitter is amazing. This should take a ribbon.</td>', 'Ice crystal? Snowflake? Whatever, it is really a beautiful shape and the way you''ve captured the glitter is amazing. This should take a ribbon.', '2003-12-16 16:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
