(514676, 50829, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, but I find the light falloff at the top and the hot spots detract a lot from the effect.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, but I find the light falloff at the top and the hot spots detract a lot from the effect.', '2003-12-16 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
