(516359, 50710, 10047, '<td valign="top">Difficult to tell where the focus point is. I might have tried moving some of the stalks out of the shot. Also would have tried darkening the shot a little.</td>', 'Difficult to tell where the focus point is. I might have tried moving some of the stalks out of the shot. Also would have tried darkening the shot a little.', '2003-12-17 22:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(516360, 50855, 10047, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but a little out of focus. Maybe the AF couldn''t decide. Are those Silver Dollars or Pirahna?</td>', 'Interesting subject, but a little out of focus. Maybe the AF couldn''t decide. Are those Silver Dollars or Pirahna?', '2003-12-17 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(516361, 50872, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent image!!  I understand why you''d want to show off  :-)<br/>Nothing I can say except - wow.<br/></td>', 'Excellent image!!  I understand why you''d want to show off  :-)Nothing I can say except - wow.', '2003-12-17 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(516363, 50668, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried for closer crop. The foreground and background seem to be in competition for my attention.</td>', 'I might have tried for closer crop. The foreground and background seem to be in competition for my attention.', '2003-12-17 22:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(516364, 50428, 8125, '<td valign="top">This has great emotive!!  It would be a wall hanger for sure for the parent of this little one.  A part of me wishes it were in color, but I also like the simplicity of b&amp;w - I really focus on the boy and penguin.  Unfortuantely this image seems to be suffering a little from focus issues - but otherwise great composition and lighting.</td>', 'This has great emotive!!  It would be a wall hanger for sure for the parent of this little one.  A part of me wishes it were in color, but I also like the simplicity of b&w - I really focus on the boy and penguin.  Unfortuantely this image seems to be suffering a little from focus issues - but otherwise great composition and lighting.', '2003-12-17 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(516365, 50436, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The handrails seem a little grainy or out of focus. I might have tried cropping out the left side of the photo.</td>', 'Good composition. The handrails seem a little grainy or out of focus. I might have tried cropping out the left side of the photo.', '2003-12-17 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(516366, 50832, 8125, '<td valign="top">I love the color and reflection in this shot.  Composition and lighting good as well.  Nice work.  :-)</td>', 'I love the color and reflection in this shot.  Composition and lighting good as well.  Nice work.  :-)', '2003-12-17 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(516368, 50806, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I like the dark blue tones in the foreground blending into the lighter shades up by the reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I like the dark blue tones in the foreground blending into the lighter shades up by the reflection.', '2003-12-17 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(516370, 50660, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional image.  I love it... one of my favorites in this challenge.  Love the color, clarity, composition, lighting, shadow, reflection of the sky on the water....  I''ll bet I see it in winners row.  :-)</td>', 'This is an exceptional image.  I love it... one of my favorites in this challenge.  Love the color, clarity, composition, lighting, shadow, reflection of the sky on the water....  I''ll bet I see it in winners row.  :-)', '2003-12-17 23:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(516371, 50905, 10047, '<td valign="top">You nailed that shot!  Great picture and nice color tones. Was the soft ray of light between the stream and drop edited in or part fo the set up?</td>', 'You nailed that shot!  Great picture and nice color tones. Was the soft ray of light between the stream and drop edited in or part fo the set up?', '2003-12-17 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(516372, 50904, 8125, '<td valign="top">Because of your lighting, the water is being washed out and is hard to see.  The spot glare from your flash is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Because of your lighting, the water is being washed out and is hard to see.  The spot glare from your flash is a bit distracting.', '2003-12-17 23:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(516373, 50891, 8125, '<td valign="top">This has got to be Arizona!?!  Good lighting, good color capture of the water...</td>', 'This has got to be Arizona!?!  Good lighting, good color capture of the water...', '2003-12-17 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(516374, 50841, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and tones. Nice compostion. Exceptional shot. I feel like I''m standing there and taking it all in. I like to enjoy these moments in the early morning before the first cast, and then disturbing the surface.</td>', 'Excellent colors and tones. Nice compostion. Exceptional shot. I feel like I''m standing there and taking it all in. I like to enjoy these moments in the early morning before the first cast, and then disturbing the surface.', '2003-12-17 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(516375, 50668, 8125, '<td valign="top">This would be better somewhat larger, you might also benefit from some contrast adjustment to let in a little more color with the grass.  Otherwise, there isn''t a lot of interest in this shot...</td>', 'This would be better somewhat larger, you might also benefit from some contrast adjustment to let in a little more color with the grass.  Otherwise, there isn''t a lot of interest in this shot...', '2003-12-17 23:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(516376, 50065, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion and sprectrum of colors from the foreground to the background. Is that a flock of birds in the upper left center?</td>', 'Nice compostion and sprectrum of colors from the foreground to the background. Is that a flock of birds in the upper left center?', '2003-12-17 23:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(516378, 50574, 8125, '<td valign="top">Funny idea... however your white is washed out and the only focus here is Homer and his donuts....</td>', 'Funny idea... however your white is washed out and the only focus here is Homer and his donuts....', '2003-12-17 23:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(516383, 50354, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, excellent capture.  Good composition and lighting.  There is some noise, I imagine from high iso - but this image is good enough to overcome that, and probably hard to avoid.  :-)</td>', 'Excellent idea, excellent capture.  Good composition and lighting.  There is some noise, I imagine from high iso - but this image is good enough to overcome that, and probably hard to avoid.  :-)', '2003-12-17 23:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(516388, 50816, 2752, '<td valign="top">a beautiful abstract..wonderful colors....nice contrast of lines and curves..the flow of water in the center gets lost somehow...otherwise very nicely done.(7)</td>', 'a beautiful abstract..wonderful colors....nice contrast of lines and curves..the flow of water in the center gets lost somehow...otherwise very nicely done.(7)', '2003-12-17 23:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(516417, 50873, 15166, '<td valign="top">its got a "renaissance" feeling, just nicely set up<br/>i like it</td>', 'its got a "renaissance" feeling, just nicely set upi like it', '2003-12-18 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(516420, 50872, 15166, '<td valign="top">whoa...wut?</td>', 'whoa...wut?', '2003-12-18 00:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(516421, 50864, 15166, '<td valign="top">calmness is goodness</td>', 'calmness is goodness', '2003-12-18 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(516423, 50795, 15166, '<td valign="top">take a real picture next time</td>', 'take a real picture next time', '2003-12-18 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(516424, 50905, 15166, '<td valign="top">couldnt of done it better myself</td>', 'couldnt of done it better myself', '2003-12-18 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(516429, 50567, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb tones. Very pleasant and engaging. 9</td>', 'Superb tones. Very pleasant and engaging. 9', '2003-12-18 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(516436, 50899, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, good composition, excellent exposure, both interesting and beautiful.  One minor issue: Seems to be a slight "faded" area almost a band across the top that''s slightly detracting from it''s otherwise perfect image!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, good composition, excellent exposure, both interesting and beautiful.  One minor issue: Seems to be a slight "faded" area almost a band across the top that''s slightly detracting from it''s otherwise perfect image!', '2003-12-18 00:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(516438, 50527, 12253, '<td valign="top">Such a good idea and case!  The left vertical band is absolutely incredible with rich texture and color.  the rest plays with the abstract pattern, but after the challenge, you might see what you could do to isolate and focus on the left portion!</td>', 'Such a good idea and case!  The left vertical band is absolutely incredible with rich texture and color.  the rest plays with the abstract pattern, but after the challenge, you might see what you could do to isolate and focus on the left portion!', '2003-12-18 00:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(516440, 50873, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion.  However, the shot loses some of its charm here in B&amp;W, particularly because it seems over contrasty and the background has hot spots, and some distracting textures.</td>', 'Good stop motion.  However, the shot loses some of its charm here in B&W, particularly because it seems over contrasty and the background has hot spots, and some distracting textures.', '2003-12-18 00:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(516461, 50660, 4482, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOW! Nothing constructive as I wouldn&lt;t change a thing!!!</td>', 'All I can say is WOW! Nothing constructive as I wouldn<t change a thing!!!', '2003-12-18 01:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(516482, 50563, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like the waterfall in the bacground, the water spraying around it makes this shot feel wet (In a good way!)<br/> <br/>The picture does however look a little dark to me, also the water at the front looks blurry.<br/> <br/>To make the water at the front better you could have used a longer exposure.  This would have made the water look silky.  Or, if you had wanted to capture the water motionless you could have used a shorter exposure. [7]</td>', 'I like the waterfall in the bacground, the water spraying around it makes this shot feel wet (In a good way!) The picture does however look a little dark to me, also the water at the front looks blurry. To make the water at the front better you could have used a longer exposure.  This would have made the water look silky.  Or, if you had wanted to capture the water motionless you could have used a shorter exposure. [7]', '2003-12-18 03:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(516525, 50715, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The black background really helps to frame the subject nicely. <br/> <br/>Would really prefer to see just a section of the subject. Your eyes wonder around not really knowing where to focus on.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The black background really helps to frame the subject nicely.  Would really prefer to see just a section of the subject. Your eyes wonder around not really knowing where to focus on.', '2003-12-18 05:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(516526, 50470, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very haunting image. Composition is quite interesting. More interest could be achieve if some of the bottom part of the composition was cropped off. Reflections in the water is very nice. Beautiful hues of blue in the water.</td>', 'Very haunting image. Composition is quite interesting. More interest could be achieve if some of the bottom part of the composition was cropped off. Reflections in the water is very nice. Beautiful hues of blue in the water.', '2003-12-18 05:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(516529, 50592, 13218, '<td valign="top">excellent water crown, but the color are distracting me, and on upper and lower corner there is too much white for me. Overall. bravo ;-) Biliana</td>', 'excellent water crown, but the color are distracting me, and on upper and lower corner there is too much white for me. Overall. bravo ;-) Biliana', '2003-12-18 06:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(516540, 50793, 13218, '<td valign="top">hm.. very good photograph. bravo ;-) is this for the contest. only if I assume that the clouds are made of water? <br/>regards, biliana</td>', 'hm.. very good photograph. bravo ;-) is this for the contest. only if I assume that the clouds are made of water? regards, biliana', '2003-12-18 07:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(516549, 50709, 8125, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for the challenge.  I really like the colors you captured.  Very nice work!</td>', 'Cool idea for the challenge.  I really like the colors you captured.  Very nice work!', '2003-12-18 07:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(516550, 50761, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous reflection shot.  Very nice work!  :-)</td>', 'This is a fabulous reflection shot.  Very nice work!  :-)', '2003-12-18 07:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(516551, 50830, 8125, '<td valign="top">Were you shooting through a tinted window?  This looks like the result of what happens when film gets too old.  The overall image quality is not very good; there may be interest in the scene, but it''s hard to make out.  Sorry....  :-(</td>', 'Were you shooting through a tinted window?  This looks like the result of what happens when film gets too old.  The overall image quality is not very good; there may be interest in the scene, but it''s hard to make out.  Sorry....  :-(', '2003-12-18 07:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(516552, 50378, 8125, '<td valign="top">Awesome - excellent capture!</td>', 'Awesome - excellent capture!', '2003-12-18 07:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(516553, 49999, 8125, '<td valign="top">This image is a little small to make out details, and it seems out of focus.  The lighting appears too harsh possibly.  I can tell there is water pouring from the top of the image, but I can''t make out anything else.</td>', 'This image is a little small to make out details, and it seems out of focus.  The lighting appears too harsh possibly.  I can tell there is water pouring from the top of the image, but I can''t make out anything else.', '2003-12-18 07:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(516561, 50852, 10705, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot ... colors, clarity and composition!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot ... colors, clarity and composition!', '2003-12-18 08:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(516566, 50746, 10705, '<td valign="top">This is very nice ... love the way the water flows through the different colored rocks.  Very nice.</td>', 'This is very nice ... love the way the water flows through the different colored rocks.  Very nice.', '2003-12-18 08:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(516570, 50870, 10705, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2003-12-18 08:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(516599, 50519, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is very busy!  It has many different layers made up of textures, colors, lines.  It is confusing to the eye.  Also the theme of the shot (water) is kind of hidden in the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is very busy!  It has many different layers made up of textures, colors, lines.  It is confusing to the eye.  Also the theme of the shot (water) is kind of hidden in the shot.TC', '2003-12-18 08:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(516600, 50761, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I like how clear the reflection is and also the colors.  Something doesn''t look right though.  I think it''s a perspective issue.  Try rotating the shot slightly before cropping it and it may resolve itself.  I would also crop out the dead flower in the foreground (or since the challenge will be over soon, clone it out in photoshop...)<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I like how clear the reflection is and also the colors.  Something doesn''t look right though.  I think it''s a perspective issue.  Try rotating the shot slightly before cropping it and it may resolve itself.  I would also crop out the dead flower in the foreground (or since the challenge will be over soon, clone it out in photoshop...)TC', '2003-12-18 08:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(516602, 50576, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally comment on borders, but in this case I think it detacts from the overall shot.  I think it''s the color of it...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t normally comment on borders, but in this case I think it detacts from the overall shot.  I think it''s the color of it...TC', '2003-12-18 08:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(516603, 50808, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it''s crooked and not crooked enough to look intention.  If it was intentional, then I don''t get it.  If it''s NOT intentional it''s an easy fix in photoshop!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot, but it''s crooked and not crooked enough to look intention.  If it was intentional, then I don''t get it.  If it''s NOT intentional it''s an easy fix in photoshop!TC', '2003-12-18 08:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(516605, 50879, 9906, '<td valign="top">Is that an Alka Seltzer?  I thought about trying something like this but ran out of time (and Alka Seltzer too now that I think about it...)  Nice clarity on the bubles behind the wafer, but the wafer itself seems a little soft (because of the tiny bubbles?)  Also, I would have cropped out the waterline or up to include it.  It looks accidental this way...<br/>TC</td>', 'Is that an Alka Seltzer?  I thought about trying something like this but ran out of time (and Alka Seltzer too now that I think about it...)  Nice clarity on the bubles behind the wafer, but the wafer itself seems a little soft (because of the tiny bubbles?)  Also, I would have cropped out the waterline or up to include it.  It looks accidental this way...TC', '2003-12-18 08:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(516607, 50668, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too small and too soft in the foreground.<br/>TC</td>', 'Too small and too soft in the foreground.TC', '2003-12-18 08:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(516609, 50087, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice in an almost surreal kind of way.  The white spot center left is a little distracting.  It wants to draw my eye there.  Selectively adjusting the levels on that spot may (or may not, I''m still learning advanced ps techniques) help with this.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice in an almost surreal kind of way.  The white spot center left is a little distracting.  It wants to draw my eye there.  Selectively adjusting the levels on that spot may (or may not, I''m still learning advanced ps techniques) help with this.TC', '2003-12-18 08:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(516611, 50436, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be an interesting shot to play around with angles and perspectives.  The way you did this shot is the typical angle used.  Next time try puttting the camera closer to the ground (below the level of the rails).  You''ll get a totally different feel.  This might not have worked for this challeng though as it would take emphasis away from the water.  Nice tones here.  The bridge almost looks like it was oversharpened a touch though.<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be an interesting shot to play around with angles and perspectives.  The way you did this shot is the typical angle used.  Next time try puttting the camera closer to the ground (below the level of the rails).  You''ll get a totally different feel.  This might not have worked for this challeng though as it would take emphasis away from the water.  Nice tones here.  The bridge almost looks like it was oversharpened a touch though.TC', '2003-12-18 08:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(516699, 50842, 11895, '<td valign="top">colors look unnatural</td>', 'colors look unnatural', '2003-12-18 10:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
