(516745, 50065, 11895, '<td valign="top">excellent photo that fits the topic well, border doesn''t add much IMHO; I would have scored it very high if not for the too obvious retouch in the clouds above the far pole</td>', 'excellent photo that fits the topic well, border doesn''t add much IMHO; I would have scored it very high if not for the too obvious retouch in the clouds above the far pole', '2003-12-18 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
