(517114, 50135, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good rule of thirds and subject.  A polarizer to cut back some of the blown areas on the water would have worked well.  The focus is a bit soft, need sharper focus on the subject to make it stand out more.</td>', 'Good rule of thirds and subject.  A polarizer to cut back some of the blown areas on the water would have worked well.  The focus is a bit soft, need sharper focus on the subject to make it stand out more.', '2003-12-18 20:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(517116, 50265, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but pretty bland.  Colors are bland, not alot of detail, and the waterfall part  is hard to see.  shot with a flash?  If the water was really coming off of their, a very long exposure may have yielded a little more interest</td>', 'Good idea, but pretty bland.  Colors are bland, not alot of detail, and the waterfall part  is hard to see.  shot with a flash?  If the water was really coming off of their, a very long exposure may have yielded a little more interest', '2003-12-18 20:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
