(517184, 50619, 14012, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the focus on the end of a drip, rather than the gutter. Don''t care much for the crop either.</td>', 'I would have liked the focus on the end of a drip, rather than the gutter. Don''t care much for the crop either.', '2003-12-18 22:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
