(517280, 50087, 14012, '<td valign="top">This is right up there as one of my favorites of the challenge. Great colors of the rocks</td>', 'This is right up there as one of my favorites of the challenge. Great colors of the rocks', '2003-12-18 22:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(517282, 50042, 10402, '<td valign="top">The snow is too white and devoid of texture to be the center of interest here. But the fruits have a great color and texture. I''d have cropped off the bunches on the right side, putting the vertical branch near the edge of the photo. As it is, that branch tends to cut the photo in half.</td>', 'The snow is too white and devoid of texture to be the center of interest here. But the fruits have a great color and texture. I''d have cropped off the bunches on the right side, putting the vertical branch near the edge of the photo. As it is, that branch tends to cut the photo in half.', '2003-12-18 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517285, 50631, 14012, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems a bit tilted and I would not have centered the sun.</td>', 'The horizon seems a bit tilted and I would not have centered the sun.', '2003-12-18 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
