(517325, 50400, 14012, '<td valign="top">If this is what I think this is, I hope you backed up before you took this. Great color and everything is in focus. Good job.<br/> <br/>Edit: Bumping from 9 to a 10. Good luck!</td>', 'If this is what I think this is, I hope you backed up before you took this. Great color and everything is in focus. Good job. Edit: Bumping from 9 to a 10. Good luck!', '2003-12-18 23:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
