(517415, 50895, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and softness of this photo.  I like the graininess of the background vs. the clarity of the droplet of water.</td>', 'I love the tones and softness of this photo.  I like the graininess of the background vs. the clarity of the droplet of water.', '2003-12-19 01:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
