(517424, 50048, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the texture, reflections and overall shape of this a lot.  Compositionally, I think the black diagonal on the left is unwanted, and I would consider maybe rotating this to make the water diagonal to the frame.  Other forms of cropping might work well too.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the texture, reflections and overall shape of this a lot.  Compositionally, I think the black diagonal on the left is unwanted, and I would consider maybe rotating this to make the water diagonal to the frame.  Other forms of cropping might work well too.  Nice work.', '2003-12-19 01:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(517425, 50042, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me worry about the snow pictures I want to take (if it ever really snows here like it\''s supposed to....)  The grapes and vines are damn near perfect, but the snow is hard to focus on.  Over exposed?<br/>Overall a nice image that could be great with a few more tries...<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot makes me worry about the snow pictures I want to take (if it ever really snows here like it\''s supposed to....)  The grapes and vines are damn near perfect, but the snow is hard to focus on.  Over exposed?Overall a nice image that could be great with a few more tries...TC', '2003-12-19 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(517427, 50849, 9906, '<td valign="top">The focus just seems a touch off here.  Colors are very nice as are the textures.  I could tell it was a macro though without the hint...<br/>TC</td>', 'The focus just seems a touch off here.  Colors are very nice as are the textures.  I could tell it was a macro though without the hint...TC', '2003-12-19 01:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(517428, 50860, 509, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the original colors of this photo.  The colors used are not very strong at conveying the old worn out message of the subject.  Also, I don''t think the framing choice is necessary.  You have a good subject, just a little too much editing imho.</td>', 'I would like to see the original colors of this photo.  The colors used are not very strong at conveying the old worn out message of the subject.  Also, I don''t think the framing choice is necessary.  You have a good subject, just a little too much editing imho.', '2003-12-19 01:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(517429, 50830, 509, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the white balance is off a bit.  Could use a stronger focus as well.  I''m not sure what the focal point of this image is...As landscapes go, I think it could be done better.</td>', 'Hmm, the white balance is off a bit.  Could use a stronger focus as well.  I''m not sure what the focal point of this image is...As landscapes go, I think it could be done better.', '2003-12-19 01:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(517430, 50400, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this has got to be one of the better shots.  I don''t know what the heck it is suposed to be, but it''s beautiful.  Nice complimenting contrasts.  Nice tones too!<br/>TC<br/>PS:  I don''t see the logic...</td>', 'Wow, this has got to be one of the better shots.  I don''t know what the heck it is suposed to be, but it''s beautiful.  Nice complimenting contrasts.  Nice tones too!TCPS:  I don''t see the logic...', '2003-12-19 01:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(517432, 50797, 9906, '<td valign="top">Now that\''s hard to look at!<br/>TC</td>', 'Now that\''s hard to look at!TC', '2003-12-19 01:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(517433, 50541, 509, '<td valign="top">I think less DOF (to make the background rocks blurry) or more to bring it all into focus would work better here.  With the limited depth of field used, it gives slightly more of an impression of missed focus.  I like that the stone in the middle right is sharp, but the rest of the image doesn''t really lead my eye there.</td>', 'I think less DOF (to make the background rocks blurry) or more to bring it all into focus would work better here.  With the limited depth of field used, it gives slightly more of an impression of missed focus.  I like that the stone in the middle right is sharp, but the rest of the image doesn''t really lead my eye there.', '2003-12-19 01:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(517438, 50704, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Looks almost like a wine glass with a beaded stem. Kind of interesting with the half black, half clear in the water.The black frame helps to make the shot seem darker.Maybe not as thick or eliminated it will help.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Looks almost like a wine glass with a beaded stem. Kind of interesting with the half black, half clear in the water.The black frame helps to make the shot seem darker.Maybe not as thick or eliminated it will help.', '2003-12-19 02:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(517439, 50768, 10084, '<td valign="top">Horizontal cropping works perfectly here, helps composition look very interesting. Nice and simple. Colors looks flat except the parasail which helps to pop out of the frame.</td>', 'Horizontal cropping works perfectly here, helps composition look very interesting. Nice and simple. Colors looks flat except the parasail which helps to pop out of the frame.', '2003-12-19 02:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(517440, 50541, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice filling the frame composition. Too bad the berries don''t have that much colors. The contrast helps to make them pop out of the shot. Very nice capture of the ice crystals.Focusing is quite good. Some good DOF.</td>', 'Nice filling the frame composition. Too bad the berries don''t have that much colors. The contrast helps to make them pop out of the shot. Very nice capture of the ice crystals.Focusing is quite good. Some good DOF.', '2003-12-19 02:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517443, 50845, 10084, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful composition. I can almost feel goosebumps looking at this. Great contrast helps to make this shot pop out. Great details in the ice and the flowing of the water.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful composition. I can almost feel goosebumps looking at this. Great contrast helps to make this shot pop out. Great details in the ice and the flowing of the water.', '2003-12-19 02:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(517446, 50709, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors were captured. Great still-motion captured. The mixer of color hues in the water is beautiful. The dark night sky frames this composition nicely.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors were captured. Great still-motion captured. The mixer of color hues in the water is beautiful. The dark night sky frames this composition nicely.', '2003-12-19 02:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(517448, 49999, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, you could have done a few things to help with your picture.<br/> <br/>Pull the camera back and zoom in to it.  Unfortunately it looks a little out of focus.  <br/> <br/>Did you use a flash?  The white spots in the picture are a bit distracting, maybe use another light but point it away from the water or bounce it off of a white piece of paper?<br/> <br/>A great idea, [6]</td>', 'This is a great idea, you could have done a few things to help with your picture. Pull the camera back and zoom in to it.  Unfortunately it looks a little out of focus.   Did you use a flash?  The white spots in the picture are a bit distracting, maybe use another light but point it away from the water or bounce it off of a white piece of paper? A great idea, [6]', '2003-12-19 02:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(517449, 50864, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot!  I like the shallow DPF, the ''bloop'' of water, the ripples and especially the little ripples near the bottom of the water that''s being poured in.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would comment on is that the picture looks a little dark.  I know that''s probably got something to do with the crappy monitor I have here at work, but the left hand side seems difficult to see. [9]</td>', 'This is a really nice shot!  I like the shallow DPF, the ''bloop'' of water, the ripples and especially the little ripples near the bottom of the water that''s being poured in. The only thing I would comment on is that the picture looks a little dark.  I know that''s probably got something to do with the crappy monitor I have here at work, but the left hand side seems difficult to see. [9]', '2003-12-19 02:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(517451, 50880, 10084, '<td valign="top">The bubbles are hypotizing. The composition is very interesting. I like how your eyes are lead from the top of the shot toward the bottom left by the bubbles (nice arc).</td>', 'The bubbles are hypotizing. The composition is very interesting. I like how your eyes are lead from the top of the shot toward the bottom left by the bubbles (nice arc).', '2003-12-19 02:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517452, 50551, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful curves produced by  the liquid (water?). Great contrasting of colors really help this shot interesting. The reflection in the edge of the water has strong presence. It almost looks a bit like fire near the bottom right corner. Highlights and shadows on the surfac that the water is sitting on is very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful curves produced by  the liquid (water?). Great contrasting of colors really help this shot interesting. The reflection in the edge of the water has strong presence. It almost looks a bit like fire near the bottom right corner. Highlights and shadows on the surfac that the water is sitting on is very nice.', '2003-12-19 02:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(517455, 50873, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!<br/> <br/>I really like the splash at the bottom.  The extra droplet of water at the top adds a great extra.  <br/> <br/>The only thing I would have liked would have been for it to be a little sharper. This would have brought out the flash more at the bottom.  Full marks! [10]</td>', 'Excellent shot! I really like the splash at the bottom.  The extra droplet of water at the top adds a great extra.   The only thing I would have liked would have been for it to be a little sharper. This would have brought out the flash more at the bottom.  Full marks! [10]', '2003-12-19 03:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(517456, 50905, 12802, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot here, good clear shot (A touch of USM might have helped bring out more details though)<br/> <br/>You could have used the clone tool here to remove some of the reflections in the droplet at the bottom?  A great shot.  [9]</td>', 'A really nice shot here, good clear shot (A touch of USM might have helped bring out more details though) You could have used the clone tool here to remove some of the reflections in the droplet at the bottom?  A great shot.  [9]', '2003-12-19 03:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(517457, 50300, 12802, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea for this challenge, B&amp;W also works well. [9]</td>', 'Brilliant idea for this challenge, B&W also works well. [9]', '2003-12-19 03:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(517458, 50852, 12802, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, nice background and a great soft feel to it.<br/> <br/>The only things I would say is to maybe sharpen it up a little, this would have brought the detail out on the leave.  <br/> <br/>You could have used the clone tool to remove the reflections of your window in the larger droplets.<br/> <br/>A great picture! [9]</td>', 'Beautiful shot, nice background and a great soft feel to it. The only things I would say is to maybe sharpen it up a little, this would have brought the detail out on the leave.   You could have used the clone tool to remove the reflections of your window in the larger droplets. A great picture! [9]', '2003-12-19 03:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(517474, 50775, 12802, '<td valign="top">A great shot here, great colours and brilliant detail.<br/> <br/>The only thing would be the little bumps in the droplets.  You could try the clone tool to get these out? [9]</td>', 'A great shot here, great colours and brilliant detail. The only thing would be the little bumps in the droplets.  You could try the clone tool to get these out? [9]', '2003-12-19 03:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(517489, 50746, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones and colours here, a great shot for the challenge. <br/> <br/>The only thing would be to have used a longer exposure.  The would have made the water look silkier.  <br/> <br/>A great shot [9]</td>', 'Excellent tones and colours here, a great shot for the challenge.  The only thing would be to have used a longer exposure.  The would have made the water look silkier.   A great shot [9]', '2003-12-19 03:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(517494, 50660, 12802, '<td valign="top">I can see this shot hanging on a wall in a gallery or something like that.  The colours are brilliant, can''t think of anything I would have liked to have seen different.  [10]</td>', 'I can see this shot hanging on a wall in a gallery or something like that.  The colours are brilliant, can''t think of anything I would have liked to have seen different.  [10]', '2003-12-19 03:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(517501, 50400, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great title, great colours...  Think the word great springs to mind?  [9]</td>', 'Great shot, great title, great colours...  Think the word great springs to mind?  [9]', '2003-12-19 03:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(517503, 50087, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot here. The long exposure works really well!  <br/> <br/>Not sure the border is needed though. [9]</td>', 'Very nice shot here. The long exposure works really well!   Not sure the border is needed though. [9]', '2003-12-19 03:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(517504, 50670, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is nice, the water rippling actually shows the water, in some of the other aquarium shots I have seen the water is so still and clear that it appears to be glass only, I like this, the colors are good and the ripples are smooth 8</td>', 'This is nice, the water rippling actually shows the water, in some of the other aquarium shots I have seen the water is so still and clear that it appears to be glass only, I like this, the colors are good and the ripples are smooth 8', '2003-12-19 03:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(517505, 50491, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot to me, the reflection of the bridge in the water was a good choice, added interest to the shot, I also like the black and white choice, this is a good shot</td>', 'This is an interesting shot to me, the reflection of the bridge in the water was a good choice, added interest to the shot, I also like the black and white choice, this is a good shot', '2003-12-19 03:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(517506, 50087, 14891, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2003-12-19 03:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517507, 50828, 10848, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much, this reminds me of my childhood when I used to sit at the window and watch the icicles drip of the edge of the roof, the clarity is wonderful and you dof is great, the background being completely removed focuses the interest on the subject, good job</td>', 'I like this shot very much, this reminds me of my childhood when I used to sit at the window and watch the icicles drip of the edge of the roof, the clarity is wonderful and you dof is great, the background being completely removed focuses the interest on the subject, good job', '2003-12-19 03:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(517508, 50884, 14891, '<td valign="top">He looks happy though?</td>', 'He looks happy though?', '2003-12-19 03:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(517509, 50428, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot, this is too cute! I like the little boy viewing this in amazement, not sure about the black and white choice on this one , as I am sure the water was probably an outstanding blue which would have been nice to see, but over all this is a fantastic shot, the clarity is good and the water shows up really well, 9</td>', 'Outstanding shot, this is too cute! I like the little boy viewing this in amazement, not sure about the black and white choice on this one , as I am sure the water was probably an outstanding blue which would have been nice to see, but over all this is a fantastic shot, the clarity is good and the water shows up really well, 9', '2003-12-19 03:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(517510, 50734, 10848, '<td valign="top">one word for this is "fantastic" I love this shot, and what an imaginative title, fits it perfectly, the colors are outstanding and the clarity of the drops are amazing 10</td>', 'one word for this is "fantastic" I love this shot, and what an imaginative title, fits it perfectly, the colors are outstanding and the clarity of the drops are amazing 10', '2003-12-19 03:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(517511, 50709, 14891, '<td valign="top">Looks like Epcot Center</td>', 'Looks like Epcot Center', '2003-12-19 03:59:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(517512, 50886, 14891, '<td valign="top">Nice title, and great shot.</td>', 'Nice title, and great shot.', '2003-12-19 03:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(517513, 50725, 10848, '<td valign="top">Good shot, the lighting is good,and the drop was captured perfectly, the colors especially the copper and brown tones are great good job</td>', 'Good shot, the lighting is good,and the drop was captured perfectly, the colors especially the copper and brown tones are great good job', '2003-12-19 04:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(517514, 50852, 10848, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot, the colors are outstanding and the lighting is great, the detail of the flower and the drops themselves are wonderful 10</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot, the colors are outstanding and the lighting is great, the detail of the flower and the drops themselves are wonderful 10', '2003-12-19 04:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(517515, 50378, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot, this is wondeful, the lighting in this shot, being the light source is streaming from the top downward is a great addition to this shot, Love the blue, and the over all feel of the sea in this shot,</td>', 'Outstanding shot, this is wondeful, the lighting in this shot, being the light source is streaming from the top downward is a great addition to this shot, Love the blue, and the over all feel of the sea in this shot,', '2003-12-19 04:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(517520, 50065, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous, looks like a beautiful painting, the reflections in the water are wonderful and the colors of the trees are great this is a wonderful shot, ranks high with me</td>', 'This is gorgeous, looks like a beautiful painting, the reflections in the water are wonderful and the colors of the trees are great this is a wonderful shot, ranks high with me', '2003-12-19 04:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(517522, 50901, 10848, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh this wonderful, you captured the essence of water with this one, giving the illusion of rain in the background and the flower, the only give away to me that this was not actually rain was the flower appeared to be silk to me, anyway you pulled this off really well, good luck.</td>', 'Oh my gosh this wonderful, you captured the essence of water with this one, giving the illusion of rain in the background and the flower, the only give away to me that this was not actually rain was the flower appeared to be silk to me, anyway you pulled this off really well, good luck.', '2003-12-19 04:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(517538, 50409, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, you captured the sky and its vivid colors perfectly, the darkness of the shot gives it that cold wintery feel I like it</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, you captured the sky and its vivid colors perfectly, the darkness of the shot gives it that cold wintery feel I like it', '2003-12-19 04:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(517539, 50896, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, looks like a beautiful post card picture, the colors are wonderful, great job</td>', 'Beautiful shot, looks like a beautiful post card picture, the colors are wonderful, great job', '2003-12-19 04:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(517560, 50722, 13905, '<td valign="top">i dont know what is it, but it looks EVIL!<br/></td>', 'i dont know what is it, but it looks EVIL!', '2003-12-19 06:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(517561, 50797, 13905, '<td valign="top">Amazing...</td>', 'Amazing...', '2003-12-19 06:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(517563, 50400, 7304, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Love the beads of water and the whole picture is sharp. The positive/negative space is real interesting in this photo. Tops 8</td>', 'Interesting composition. Love the beads of water and the whole picture is sharp. The positive/negative space is real interesting in this photo. Tops 8', '2003-12-19 06:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(517564, 50728, 7304, '<td valign="top">Rusty old sink adds some great color. The ripples are a great catch. Nice and sharp. Great water shot. 7</td>', 'Rusty old sink adds some great color. The ripples are a great catch. Nice and sharp. Great water shot. 7', '2003-12-19 06:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(517565, 50715, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love this macro. Nice clarity and well cropped. I like the way the ice crystals formed. You can tell the way the wind was blowing. 7</td>', 'Love this macro. Nice clarity and well cropped. I like the way the ice crystals formed. You can tell the way the wind was blowing. 7', '2003-12-19 06:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(517566, 50870, 7304, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Liquid and frozen water. Nice composition and a clean shot. 7</td>', 'Beautiful. Liquid and frozen water. Nice composition and a clean shot. 7', '2003-12-19 06:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(517568, 50048, 7304, '<td valign="top">Too cool. Love the texture and this is real sharp. Some interesting shapes happening here with the use of light. Great shot. 7</td>', 'Too cool. Love the texture and this is real sharp. Some interesting shapes happening here with the use of light. Great shot. 7', '2003-12-19 06:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(517569, 50678, 7304, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Bubbles are a great addition. Nice and sharp. Good composition. 7</td>', 'Excellent capture. Bubbles are a great addition. Nice and sharp. Good composition. 7', '2003-12-19 06:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(517570, 50841, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Still water. I would have rated it a bit better if the water grass wasn''t the main focus in the picture. It''s a great shot and the border helps and it does fit the challenge. 6</td>', 'Nice shot. Still water. I would have rated it a bit better if the water grass wasn''t the main focus in the picture. It''s a great shot and the border helps and it does fit the challenge. 6', '2003-12-19 06:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(517571, 50660, 7304, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Love the color. The reflection of the chain/float &amp; clouds adds a lot of interest to this photo. Nice and sharp and great light. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot. Love the color. The reflection of the chain/float & clouds adds a lot of interest to this photo. Nice and sharp and great light. 8', '2003-12-19 06:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(517572, 50864, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. Nice and clean. Good composition and use of light. 7</td>', 'Nice action shot. Nice and clean. Good composition and use of light. 7', '2003-12-19 06:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(517573, 50905, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Like the way the beads of water start to form. 6</td>', 'Nice shot. Like the way the beads of water start to form. 6', '2003-12-19 06:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(517576, 50737, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. The water jug/jar leads you to what the main focus should be "water". Nice and sharp and the color is great. 7</td>', 'Nice and simple. The water jug/jar leads you to what the main focus should be "water". Nice and sharp and the color is great. 7', '2003-12-19 06:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(517601, 50561, 10869, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the glass not to be upside down</td>', 'I would have preferred the glass not to be upside down', '2003-12-19 07:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(517609, 50791, 7703, '<td valign="top">Hmmm this is nothing I would like to print out and hang up on my wall. Not much of a woww in it. But there is a water ... give you 4</td>', 'Hmmm this is nothing I would like to print out and hang up on my wall. Not much of a woww in it. But there is a water ... give you 4', '2003-12-19 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(517612, 50897, 2553, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and interesting!  I love the warm colors, and the dof is great for emphasizing your droplet.  Not sure what all is reflected in the drop, but I can certainly see the star and some other visually interesting lines and angles.  I might have favored a narrower crop on this - there seems to be SO much space around the drop. Nevertheless, I find it quite visually engaging.  9</td>', 'Imaginative and interesting!  I love the warm colors, and the dof is great for emphasizing your droplet.  Not sure what all is reflected in the drop, but I can certainly see the star and some other visually interesting lines and angles.  I might have favored a narrower crop on this - there seems to be SO much space around the drop. Nevertheless, I find it quite visually engaging.  9', '2003-12-19 08:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(517613, 50709, 2553, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge, this is an amazing shot!   Beautiful colors, perfect lighting, and a very imaginative shot. 10</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge, this is an amazing shot!   Beautiful colors, perfect lighting, and a very imaginative shot. 10', '2003-12-19 08:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(517614, 50872, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  The addition of the frozen foreground in this shot really makes it for me.  Love the compositional framing of the shot; it makes it a very strong image. 9</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  The addition of the frozen foreground in this shot really makes it for me.  Love the compositional framing of the shot; it makes it a very strong image. 9', '2003-12-19 08:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(517615, 50561, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the look of the water splash, and your lighting looks perfect.  The glass looks odd to me just hanging perfectly straight upside down "in the air".   Also, I don''t care for the perfectly centered composition - it just doesn''t seem dynamic enough. 8</td>', 'Love the look of the water splash, and your lighting looks perfect.  The glass looks odd to me just hanging perfectly straight upside down "in the air".   Also, I don''t care for the perfectly centered composition - it just doesn''t seem dynamic enough. 8', '2003-12-19 08:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(517619, 50664, 8159, '<td valign="top">Very cool background! I can''t figure out what it is, but I love the soft "rolling" lines. Interesting way to show the diffraction effects (or whatever it is called) of water. If this was in color, the water would remind me of what motor oil looks like on water. Oh, and I really like how the wire is silhouetted as well so that your focus is drawn to the water in the loop and the background.</td>', 'Very cool background! I can''t figure out what it is, but I love the soft "rolling" lines. Interesting way to show the diffraction effects (or whatever it is called) of water. If this was in color, the water would remind me of what motor oil looks like on water. Oh, and I really like how the wire is silhouetted as well so that your focus is drawn to the water in the loop and the background.', '2003-12-19 09:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(517621, 50670, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nicely shows different effects of water on light: mostly reflective at the bottom, transparent at the top, and refractive in the middle.</td>', 'Nicely shows different effects of water on light: mostly reflective at the bottom, transparent at the top, and refractive in the middle.', '2003-12-19 09:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(517625, 50664, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and I like the wonderful effect you got with a very simple device.  Super shot!</td>', 'Very nice capture and I like the wonderful effect you got with a very simple device.  Super shot!', '2003-12-19 09:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(517627, 50670, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and reflection...</td>', 'Nice colors and reflection...', '2003-12-19 09:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(517631, 50721, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the transition between fall and winter. The bank is so close too the center and the difference between top and bottom so great that the photo is almost split in two; a composition that should be avoided in general, but I do think it works here. Cropping off most of the ice at the bottom or (more appropriately for the challenge) most of the sky at the top would have created very different images--probably more dramatic ones. But not, I think, with as clear of a message about the subtle boundary between fall and winter. (Or maybe I\''m just thinking too much about the \"on the edge\" challenge!)</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the transition between fall and winter. The bank is so close too the center and the difference between top and bottom so great that the photo is almost split in two; a composition that should be avoided in general, but I do think it works here. Cropping off most of the ice at the bottom or (more appropriately for the challenge) most of the sky at the top would have created very different images--probably more dramatic ones. But not, I think, with as clear of a message about the subtle boundary between fall and winter. (Or maybe I\''m just thinking too much about the \"on the edge\" challenge!)', '2003-12-19 09:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(517632, 50519, 8637, '<td valign="top">Lot of potential with this shot...seems too busy on the right with a lot of clutter while left side is gray and nondescriptive.  A lower shot face on to the spouts might be better?</td>', 'Lot of potential with this shot...seems too busy on the right with a lot of clutter while left side is gray and nondescriptive.  A lower shot face on to the spouts might be better?', '2003-12-19 09:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(517634, 50850, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus, but nice shot.</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus, but nice shot.', '2003-12-19 09:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(517635, 50846, 8637, '<td valign="top">I think the border and dark blobs on trhe edges take away some from this one.</td>', 'I think the border and dark blobs on trhe edges take away some from this one.', '2003-12-19 09:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(517641, 50567, 8637, '<td valign="top">Would love to have seen this one in color.</td>', 'Would love to have seen this one in color.', '2003-12-19 09:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(517644, 50690, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...would prefer the light in the window not be so bright...but beautiful capture!</td>', 'Beautiful...would prefer the light in the window not be so bright...but beautiful capture!', '2003-12-19 09:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(517645, 50704, 8637, '<td valign="top">You have bit of pixelation/radiating bands in the background.</td>', 'You have bit of pixelation/radiating bands in the background.', '2003-12-19 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(517652, 50547, 11521, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast<br/></td>', 'Wonderful contrast', '2003-12-19 10:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(517655, 50724, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice...wonderful use of space.</td>', 'Very nice...wonderful use of space.', '2003-12-19 10:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(517658, 50870, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful snowscene. I like the stark contrasts.</td>', 'Beautiful snowscene. I like the stark contrasts.', '2003-12-19 10:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(517661, 50872, 11895, '<td valign="top">a little too much frame</td>', 'a little too much frame', '2003-12-19 10:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(517664, 50833, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Well done and excellent lighting...neat title also.</td>', 'Great idea!  Well done and excellent lighting...neat title also.', '2003-12-19 10:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(517665, 50830, 8637, '<td valign="top">Colors seem too dark...really does not seem to emphasize snow.</td>', 'Colors seem too dark...really does not seem to emphasize snow.', '2003-12-19 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(517670, 50818, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. A lot of interesting colors, shapes, and textures to fire the viewer''s imagination.</td>', 'Nice abstract. A lot of interesting colors, shapes, and textures to fire the viewer''s imagination.', '2003-12-19 10:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(517671, 50722, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and critter!</td>', 'Nice colors and critter!', '2003-12-19 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(517672, 50842, 8637, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, but would have cropped more out of the brown, dead vegetation on right.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, but would have cropped more out of the brown, dead vegetation on right.', '2003-12-19 10:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(517674, 50872, 12654, '<td valign="top">Lovely - simply wonderfull.</td>', 'Lovely - simply wonderfull.', '2003-12-19 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(517675, 50520, 8637, '<td valign="top">Little dark and looks like a small hair in the droplet.  (picky, picky!)</td>', 'Little dark and looks like a small hair in the droplet.  (picky, picky!)', '2003-12-19 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517676, 50354, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice color and shapes, but I think I''d like it better without the noise.</td>', 'Nice color and shapes, but I think I''d like it better without the noise.', '2003-12-19 10:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(517714, 50797, 12654, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea.</td>', 'Really nice idea.', '2003-12-19 10:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(517734, 50725, 10402, '<td valign="top">The unfocused coins make a great background. Good composition.</td>', 'The unfocused coins make a great background. Good composition.', '2003-12-19 11:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(517741, 50567, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very nice, although I think a vertical format would have worked better. I like this in monochrome; it emphasizes the wide range of tones (perhaps too wide to capture effectively with a camera, but it''s done reasonably well here).</td>', 'Very nice, although I think a vertical format would have worked better. I like this in monochrome; it emphasizes the wide range of tones (perhaps too wide to capture effectively with a camera, but it''s done reasonably well here).', '2003-12-19 11:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(517742, 50852, 10402, '<td valign="top">Delicate and beautiful. Great background.</td>', 'Delicate and beautiful. Great background.', '2003-12-19 11:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
