(517867, 50890, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shadows and light! The drip of water adds to the image. Just too bad the water drop didn''t fall off the spigot in the image.</td>', 'Interesting use of shadows and light! The drip of water adds to the image. Just too bad the water drop didn''t fall off the spigot in the image.', '2003-12-19 15:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(517868, 50048, 8054, '<td valign="top">The shapes water takes while in the air always interests me as the shapes can be infinite. This looks like the type of picture I''d try to capture. Very T2-like (as in Terminator 2)! Although, I think you could have cropped the left side a bit tighter to isolate the water better. That''s the only thing from a higher vote from me.</td>', 'The shapes water takes while in the air always interests me as the shapes can be infinite. This looks like the type of picture I''d try to capture. Very T2-like (as in Terminator 2)! Although, I think you could have cropped the left side a bit tighter to isolate the water better. That''s the only thing from a higher vote from me.', '2003-12-19 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517870, 50904, 8054, '<td valign="top">Harsh light source and harsh shadows.</td>', 'Harsh light source and harsh shadows.', '2003-12-19 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(517871, 50806, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very very nice! I might have cropped the bottom a bit closer but not that important. Another minor detail: the border you made is not complete but that doesn''t distract from the rating.</td>', 'Very very nice! I might have cropped the bottom a bit closer but not that important. Another minor detail: the border you made is not complete but that doesn''t distract from the rating.', '2003-12-19 15:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(517878, 50520, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent image! My only comment is with the lighting. It looks like you used fluorescent lighting, which is fine with me, but the reflection the source casts on the water drop is very visible.</td>', 'Excellent image! My only comment is with the lighting. It looks like you used fluorescent lighting, which is fine with me, but the reflection the source casts on the water drop is very visible.', '2003-12-19 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(517888, 50737, 11800, '<td valign="top">I have to comment on this. It''s so clean and uncomplicated. Good job with the colors and exposure. Personally, it has been sharpened too much for my taste, but that doesn''t take away form an excellent image.</td>', 'I have to comment on this. It''s so clean and uncomplicated. Good job with the colors and exposure. Personally, it has been sharpened too much for my taste, but that doesn''t take away form an excellent image.', '2003-12-19 16:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
