(517901, 50845, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty place. The colors look a bit dull and splotchy. Did you think of cropping off the top half and just showing the icy falls. I bet they were a beautiful bluish color.  Did you desaturate them?</td>', 'Pretty place. The colors look a bit dull and splotchy. Did you think of cropping off the top half and just showing the icy falls. I bet they were a beautiful bluish color.  Did you desaturate them?', '2003-12-19 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
