(517913, 50745, 11800, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit overexposed and out of focus. Pinks do that to my camera too. Maybe use a lower ev if you can set that on your camera. Try some different compositions next time, or try rotating and cropping to get a better angle after you transfer to your computer. Work with levels and your histogram to get it a little darker. But the most important thing is to start with a sharp image.</td>', 'It looks a bit overexposed and out of focus. Pinks do that to my camera too. Maybe use a lower ev if you can set that on your camera. Try some different compositions next time, or try rotating and cropping to get a better angle after you transfer to your computer. Work with levels and your histogram to get it a little darker. But the most important thing is to start with a sharp image.', '2003-12-19 17:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(517917, 50841, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the reeds and the colors.  By keeping them as the focus, it lessens the impact of the mountains and shoreline, maybe helping me think how small we humans are compared to nature.I don''t know about the half and half composition. I guess it would have been more effective if there were reeds on the right side to balance it out.</td>', 'I like the reeds and the colors.  By keeping them as the focus, it lessens the impact of the mountains and shoreline, maybe helping me think how small we humans are compared to nature.I don''t know about the half and half composition. I guess it would have been more effective if there were reeds on the right side to balance it out.', '2003-12-19 17:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(517918, 50835, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this.  A true natural water color. Did you try pumping up the saturation to bring out those purples and blues in there? Lovely image either way.</td>', 'I like this.  A true natural water color. Did you try pumping up the saturation to bring out those purples and blues in there? Lovely image either way.', '2003-12-19 17:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(517919, 50894, 7474, '<td valign="top">love the purple colors you captured, beautiful done.<br/>The loer part alomost looks like some kind of galaxy, really mysterious :D</td>', 'love the purple colors you captured, beautiful done.The loer part alomost looks like some kind of galaxy, really mysterious :D', '2003-12-19 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
