(517929, 50832, 9387, '<td valign="top">I love your photo.  The color tone is great and I like the subject matter.  Composition is good and I like the reflections in the water.  Also like the lighthouse in the background.</td>', 'I love your photo.  The color tone is great and I like the subject matter.  Composition is good and I like the reflections in the water.  Also like the lighthouse in the background.', '2003-12-19 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
