(518007, 50619, 11800, '<td valign="top">It was difficult to find the water in this shot because of the overexposure. I do sorta like it though. Maybe just a tad more contrast would have helped. Yes. I do like it and its watercolor feel. Good luck.</td>', 'It was difficult to find the water in this shot because of the overexposure. I do sorta like it though. Maybe just a tad more contrast would have helped. Yes. I do like it and its watercolor feel. Good luck.', '2003-12-19 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(518008, 50473, 14401, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.  Glass? made some reflections and glare, unnatural looking droplets.  Could I do better?  Not on your life!  So I think it deserves an 8 anyway!</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.  Glass? made some reflections and glare, unnatural looking droplets.  Could I do better?  Not on your life!  So I think it deserves an 8 anyway!', '2003-12-19 20:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(518009, 50527, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing viewpoint and a nice take on the challenge. <br/> <br/>I like this for its abstract angle and wonder if the contextual material on the right would be better cropped out which would leave the viewer more disoriented, making even stronger use of the ragged line on the left. This woould lose some shape in the oil though but just obscuring that side with my hand does make for an excellent abstract without giving the game away. [9]</td>', 'Very intriguing viewpoint and a nice take on the challenge.  I like this for its abstract angle and wonder if the contextual material on the right would be better cropped out which would leave the viewer more disoriented, making even stronger use of the ragged line on the left. This woould lose some shape in the oil though but just obscuring that side with my hand does make for an excellent abstract without giving the game away. [9]', '2003-12-19 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(518010, 50561, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very neat picture.  The old glass in the aquarium setup?  The only thing I don''t like is the roundness at the base of the glass - but I still think the image is excellent!</td>', 'Very neat picture.  The old glass in the aquarium setup?  The only thing I don''t like is the roundness at the base of the glass - but I still think the image is excellent!', '2003-12-19 20:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(518013, 50048, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a great capture - very glacial and crisp. <br/> <br/>If I block out the dark shape on the left though the image feels more relaxing and harmonious to look at, so I would have rotated it and cropped the black stuff out so that the lines were vertical. Great focus throughout.</td>', 'It''s a great capture - very glacial and crisp.  If I block out the dark shape on the left though the image feels more relaxing and harmonious to look at, so I would have rotated it and cropped the black stuff out so that the lines were vertical. Great focus throughout.', '2003-12-19 20:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(518014, 50592, 14401, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite decipher this shot aside from the wine glass at the top, but I like the colors!</td>', 'I can''t quite decipher this shot aside from the wine glass at the top, but I like the colors!', '2003-12-19 20:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(518016, 50891, 8860, '<td valign="top">Makes you think about things this - very good concept and an excellent choice of view.</td>', 'Makes you think about things this - very good concept and an excellent choice of view.', '2003-12-19 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(518017, 50438, 13749, '<td valign="top">really seems like the horizon is titlted in this picture.. nice exposure, however - the water in the air is a nice touch =)</td>', 'really seems like the horizon is titlted in this picture.. nice exposure, however - the water in the air is a nice touch =)', '2003-12-19 20:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(518019, 50737, 14401, '<td valign="top">How simple and lovely - Nice background color, nice sharp pitcher colors, sparklingly clear water!   I''m revising upward on second look to 9.</td>', 'How simple and lovely - Nice background color, nice sharp pitcher colors, sparklingly clear water!   I''m revising upward on second look to 9.', '2003-12-19 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(518020, 50400, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and definition although there''s something slightly bothersome with the composition. It could be the cropping at the top right or the object to the left, I can''t put my finger on it. Very smart nonetheless.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and definition although there''s something slightly bothersome with the composition. It could be the cropping at the top right or the object to the left, I can''t put my finger on it. Very smart nonetheless.', '2003-12-19 20:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(518022, 50065, 8860, '<td valign="top">Amazing sunlight and beautiful composition. The flock of birds is just too distant to form an emotive part of the shot which is frustrating. I also think that the post on the left is not quite prominent enough in the composition - which coul dhave been improved if you were closer to it and it pierced the skyline (which may not have been possible). Lovely scene.</td>', 'Amazing sunlight and beautiful composition. The flock of birds is just too distant to form an emotive part of the shot which is frustrating. I also think that the post on the left is not quite prominent enough in the composition - which coul dhave been improved if you were closer to it and it pierced the skyline (which may not have been possible). Lovely scene.', '2003-12-19 20:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(518026, 50042, 13749, '<td valign="top">a little overly bright in some regions of snow, to the point that detail is lost.  otherwise, a nice picture.</td>', 'a little overly bright in some regions of snow, to the point that detail is lost.  otherwise, a nice picture.', '2003-12-19 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(518027, 50527, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is this refraction on ice? The colors, textures and shapes make an interesting abstract.</td>', 'Is this refraction on ice? The colors, textures and shapes make an interesting abstract.', '2003-12-19 20:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518028, 50817, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast of forms and motion - crisp, clear and refreshing to look at. Good job. [9]</td>', 'Lovely contrast of forms and motion - crisp, clear and refreshing to look at. Good job. [9]', '2003-12-19 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(518030, 50761, 12733, '<td valign="top">The still water makes a nearly perfect mirror. Very pretty shot. I kind of wonder what the effect would be if you tossed a stone into the water and shot while the rippes were still moving.</td>', 'The still water makes a nearly perfect mirror. Very pretty shot. I kind of wonder what the effect would be if you tossed a stone into the water and shot while the rippes were still moving.', '2003-12-19 20:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(518033, 50816, 11800, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors that are not over the edge.</td>', 'Stunning colors that are not over the edge.', '2003-12-19 20:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(518035, 50872, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like the scene and composotion - river looks beautiful. Focus is a little soft on the motionless areas though. Border is a bit too haeavy too.</td>', 'I like the scene and composotion - river looks beautiful. Focus is a little soft on the motionless areas though. Border is a bit too haeavy too.', '2003-12-19 20:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(518036, 50901, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is that really ice or glass or plastic that looks like ice? The water droplets make a very effective pattern and work well with the basic shape.</td>', 'Is that really ice or glass or plastic that looks like ice? The water droplets make a very effective pattern and work well with the basic shape.', '2003-12-19 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(518037, 50892, 11800, '<td valign="top">Original for this challenge. If it''s real, you did a wonderful job, if not, you did a wonderful job thinking of it.</td>', 'Original for this challenge. If it''s real, you did a wonderful job, if not, you did a wonderful job thinking of it.', '2003-12-19 20:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(518038, 50833, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of space in the shot although I can\\\''t decide what that really does for it. I do prefer natural ice forms though and maybe this piece of ice just isn\\\''t interesting enough. DOF is a bit narrow but it\\\''s a pretty picture overall.<br/> <br/>How did you get superscript in your title?</td>', 'Nice bit of space in the shot although I can\\\''t decide what that really does for it. I do prefer natural ice forms though and maybe this piece of ice just isn\\\''t interesting enough. DOF is a bit narrow but it\\\''s a pretty picture overall. How did you get superscript in your title?', '2003-12-19 20:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(518039, 50438, 12733, '<td valign="top">The foggy effect is moody and mysterious. IMHO it needs some sharp object in the foreground to contrast with all that softness.</td>', 'The foggy effect is moody and mysterious. IMHO it needs some sharp object in the foreground to contrast with all that softness.', '2003-12-19 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(518040, 50892, 8860, '<td valign="top">Snowflakes always appeal to me. I don''t see much benefit in the space around it though so I would have filled the frame more. Good focus and lighting.</td>', 'Snowflakes always appeal to me. I don''t see much benefit in the space around it though so I would have filled the frame more. Good focus and lighting.', '2003-12-19 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(518043, 50710, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way the focus gradually loses sharpness as you go back. The very sharp branch in the front gives a sense of perspective and depth.</td>', 'I like the way the focus gradually loses sharpness as you go back. The very sharp branch in the front gives a sense of perspective and depth.', '2003-12-19 20:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(518044, 50886, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute pun in the title, very nice shot. I like the way you lighted the glass to get the feeling of transparency and reflectiveness.</td>', 'Cute pun in the title, very nice shot. I like the way you lighted the glass to get the feeling of transparency and reflectiveness.', '2003-12-19 20:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(518046, 50631, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of the frolicking waves - at a great time of day too. The reflection of the sun looks strange though - almost impossible - and actually is a distraction for me which draws the eye away from the lovely detail in the splashes.</td>', 'Lovely capture of the frolicking waves - at a great time of day too. The reflection of the sun looks strange though - almost impossible - and actually is a distraction for me which draws the eye away from the lovely detail in the splashes.', '2003-12-19 20:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(518049, 50793, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very unusual take on the challenge and I really like it. The God rays and the colour are great, but there''s just a little too much movement in the stars. What are the lights - Aurora - the Sun?<br/> <br/>Some voters may not register the connection with water, so it''s a brave submission. [8]</td>', 'Very unusual take on the challenge and I really like it. The God rays and the colour are great, but there''s just a little too much movement in the stars. What are the lights - Aurora - the Sun? Some voters may not register the connection with water, so it''s a brave submission. [8]', '2003-12-19 20:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(518051, 50809, 13749, '<td valign="top">i would liked it just slightly more if it hadn''t been cropped/framed only slightly lower on the bottom - but still a great idea and picture.</td>', 'i would liked it just slightly more if it hadn''t been cropped/framed only slightly lower on the bottom - but still a great idea and picture.', '2003-12-19 20:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(518052, 50661, 8860, '<td valign="top">Everything is a bit indistinct in this which is amplified by the sepia effect. The motion would need to be absolutely frozen for this to work, and there''s not enough light to allow that to happen. The subject lacks a definite focal point and the point of view is quite ordinary (eye-level).</td>', 'Everything is a bit indistinct in this which is amplified by the sepia effect. The motion would need to be absolutely frozen for this to work, and there''s not enough light to allow that to happen. The subject lacks a definite focal point and the point of view is quite ordinary (eye-level).', '2003-12-19 20:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(518053, 50896, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems oversaturated....and the brown/gold grasses on the left tend to dominate the image....nice scene though.</td>', 'Seems oversaturated....and the brown/gold grasses on the left tend to dominate the image....nice scene though.', '2003-12-19 20:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(518054, 49999, 8860, '<td valign="top">Fun for you maybe but this is tough o the eyes!  ;)<br/> <br/>It''s quite out of focus this, and lacks a strong concept. The focal point is missing and there seems to be little attempt to achieve any focused clarity at all. This has nothing to do with the small size of the image which doesn''t bother me at all.</td>', 'Fun for you maybe but this is tough o the eyes!  ;) It''s quite out of focus this, and lacks a strong concept. The focal point is missing and there seems to be little attempt to achieve any focused clarity at all. This has nothing to do with the small size of the image which doesn''t bother me at all.', '2003-12-19 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(518055, 50745, 8637, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2003-12-19 20:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(518056, 50901, 8637, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2003-12-19 20:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(518057, 50763, 8637, '<td valign="top">Probably would have cropped a little tighter from the top.  Neat idea though.</td>', 'Probably would have cropped a little tighter from the top.  Neat idea though.', '2003-12-19 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(518058, 50619, 8637, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what this is and the blue windows on the right distract from the image.</td>', 'Hard to tell what this is and the blue windows on the right distract from the image.', '2003-12-19 21:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(518059, 50828, 8860, '<td valign="top">... but a bad finish! Just kidding.<br/> <br/>DOF is quite narrow on this which I find a bit distracting. You could have got closer to this if you''re not interested in focusing on the surrounding snow, as there is a fair bit of ''dead zone'' around the subject. Moving around the icicle to get some directional light would have yielded more form in the ice rather than backlighting it.</td>', '... but a bad finish! Just kidding. DOF is quite narrow on this which I find a bit distracting. You could have got closer to this if you''re not interested in focusing on the surrounding snow, as there is a fair bit of ''dead zone'' around the subject. Moving around the icicle to get some directional light would have yielded more form in the ice rather than backlighting it.', '2003-12-19 21:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518062, 50904, 8860, '<td valign="top">Flash has killed definition in the water and the subject has all but dissappeared. Focus is quite soft too, so manual would be the way to go if you have the feature. Strong light would be another requirement in order to ''freeze'' the water successfully.</td>', 'Flash has killed definition in the water and the subject has all but dissappeared. Focus is quite soft too, so manual would be the way to go if you have the feature. Strong light would be another requirement in order to ''freeze'' the water successfully.', '2003-12-19 21:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(518065, 50830, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to have to state the bleedin'' obvious but this is too blue for me. The effect of colour seems to have replaced a strong subject.<br/> <br/>I see snow, and therefore water, but the scene is too indistinct and uninteresting. It lacks a focal point, so getting low down with some branches or foreground in the frame would help to add dimension.</td>', 'I''m sorry to have to state the bleedin'' obvious but this is too blue for me. The effect of colour seems to have replaced a strong subject. I see snow, and therefore water, but the scene is too indistinct and uninteresting. It lacks a focal point, so getting low down with some branches or foreground in the frame would help to add dimension.', '2003-12-19 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(518067, 50660, 3724, '<td valign="top">Floating buoy -  with a shape reminiscent of a Christmas tree ornament.  The calm water, black reflection and mirrored looking glass sky create a unique photo.  Complements on your 4x Hasselblad format, you have made good use of this crop style, which seems to have become prevalent with many shooters.  Really good shot.  <br/></td>', 'Floating buoy -  with a shape reminiscent of a Christmas tree ornament.  The calm water, black reflection and mirrored looking glass sky create a unique photo.  Complements on your 4x Hasselblad format, you have made good use of this crop style, which seems to have become prevalent with many shooters.  Really good shot.  ', '2003-12-19 21:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(518069, 50745, 8860, '<td valign="top">If you''re gong to attempt a macro like this then a tripod is essential (or at least a steady hand). I won''t say the obvious line, but next time it would be worth taking a bit more time to find a way to steady the camera.</td>', 'If you''re gong to attempt a macro like this then a tripod is essential (or at least a steady hand). I won''t say the obvious line, but next time it would be worth taking a bit more time to find a way to steady the camera.', '2003-12-19 21:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(518071, 50878, 8860, '<td valign="top">There are some nice reflections going on here and the star is a good colour. It just lacks interest for me and the central position of the star doesn''t help either.</td>', 'There are some nice reflections going on here and the star is a good colour. It just lacks interest for me and the central position of the star doesn''t help either.', '2003-12-19 21:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(518073, 50808, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea but the image is heavily rotated and quite blurred. It looks a bit too high contrast too with the whites overexposed.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea but the image is heavily rotated and quite blurred. It looks a bit too high contrast too with the whites overexposed.', '2003-12-19 21:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(518078, 50400, 3724, '<td valign="top">Absolute flawless cold precision.......  every visual component has turned to a polished metalic substance......</td>', 'Absolute flawless cold precision.......  every visual component has turned to a polished metalic substance......', '2003-12-19 21:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(518084, 50660, 15217, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.. purfect!</td>', 'I love this shot.. purfect!', '2003-12-19 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(518087, 50179, 3724, '<td valign="top">I like the lower two thirds of this pic.  The interesting ice hanging on the tree is subtle and has a natural visual connection to the falls behind it.  A good candidate for a 4x crop.</td>', 'I like the lower two thirds of this pic.  The interesting ice hanging on the tree is subtle and has a natural visual connection to the falls behind it.  A good candidate for a 4x crop.', '2003-12-19 22:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(518093, 50872, 3724, '<td valign="top">pastorial scenic view......</td>', 'pastorial scenic view......', '2003-12-19 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(518100, 50797, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am really confused.  Should i like it because of the creativity, and skill of the shot, or hate it is hard on the eyes and makes me dizzy?  I will vote somewhere in beween.  Great capture.</td>', 'I am really confused.  Should i like it because of the creativity, and skill of the shot, or hate it is hard on the eyes and makes me dizzy?  I will vote somewhere in beween.  Great capture.', '2003-12-19 23:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(518106, 50709, 14012, '<td valign="top">Good focus. I like the colors. 8</td>', 'Good focus. I like the colors. 8', '2003-12-19 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518108, 50892, 14012, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and good focus.</td>', 'Nice macro and good focus.', '2003-12-19 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(518116, 50519, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition seem very busy. If you were to trim off the right side of the shot and just left the water contraption in the shot, your eyes would get a better flow. Right now your eyes wanter around trying to find a subject to focus on. Sometimes the simpler the picture the better the composition.</td>', 'Composition seem very busy. If you were to trim off the right side of the shot and just left the water contraption in the shot, your eyes would get a better flow. Right now your eyes wanter around trying to find a subject to focus on. Sometimes the simpler the picture the better the composition.', '2003-12-20 00:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(518119, 50354, 10084, '<td valign="top">The composition is wonderful and very nice to look at, but it doesn''t seem to pop out. Increasing the contrast would definitely benefit this shot. Getting that dark background blacker would help.</td>', 'The composition is wonderful and very nice to look at, but it doesn''t seem to pop out. Increasing the contrast would definitely benefit this shot. Getting that dark background blacker would help.', '2003-12-20 00:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(518131, 50832, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot here.  Great focus and DOF.  Love the way the lines compliment each other.   I think I would have tried to crop out or move around so that all the floating stuff in the foreground wasn''t there...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice shot here.  Great focus and DOF.  Love the way the lines compliment each other.   I think I would have tried to crop out or move around so that all the floating stuff in the foreground wasn''t there...TC', '2003-12-20 00:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(518133, 50904, 9906, '<td valign="top">I tried a shot similar to this once and couldn''t even get this much of a shower affect.  I believe that you need enormous amounts of light to make this work.  Did you use a flash or an outside litesource or both?  Nice try.  If you get one to come out real good I wanna see it!<br/>TC</td>', 'I tried a shot similar to this once and couldn''t even get this much of a shower affect.  I believe that you need enormous amounts of light to make this work.  Did you use a flash or an outside litesource or both?  Nice try.  If you get one to come out real good I wanna see it!TC', '2003-12-20 00:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(518134, 50871, 9906, '<td valign="top">A more interesting angle would make this work much better.  Try getting close to the ground!<br/>TC</td>', 'A more interesting angle would make this work much better.  Try getting close to the ground!TC', '2003-12-20 00:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518135, 50547, 9906, '<td valign="top">Don''t see no water...<br/>TC</td>', 'Don''t see no water...TC', '2003-12-20 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(518138, 50848, 13749, '<td valign="top">not sure if it''s the focus or possibly too slow of a shutter speed, but something seems slightly out of focus here.</td>', 'not sure if it''s the focus or possibly too slow of a shutter speed, but something seems slightly out of focus here.', '2003-12-20 00:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(518140, 50670, 9906, '<td valign="top">A more interesting angle and composition would serve to give this shot more interest value.<br/>TC</td>', 'A more interesting angle and composition would serve to give this shot more interest value.TC', '2003-12-20 00:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(518141, 50872, 9906, '<td valign="top">I\''m not sure I like how quickly your eye is whisked through this shot...  I think it need a little more of reference points to make it more effective IMHO  Definatly interesting though!<br/>TC</td>', 'I\''m not sure I like how quickly your eye is whisked through this shot...  I think it need a little more of reference points to make it more effective IMHO  Definatly interesting though!TC', '2003-12-20 00:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(518144, 50551, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not real sure what I''m looking at.  This needs some point of reference.  Is it tile?  A beach of some sort?  I don''t know and am confused.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not real sure what I''m looking at.  This needs some point of reference.  Is it tile?  A beach of some sort?  I don''t know and am confused.TC', '2003-12-20 00:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(518147, 50870, 10084, '<td valign="top">Breathe taking scene. Feeling the goosebumps from the shot. Composition would be perfect if maybe a bit of the bottom was cropped so that the bottom right snow was cut out. I think it interferes and distracts your eyes . Doing so would give a nice curving flow for the river/creek.</td>', 'Breathe taking scene. Feeling the goosebumps from the shot. Composition would be perfect if maybe a bit of the bottom was cropped so that the bottom right snow was cut out. I think it interferes and distracts your eyes . Doing so would give a nice curving flow for the river/creek.', '2003-12-20 00:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(518154, 50890, 13749, '<td valign="top">nice, but missing the middle/bottom porton of this faucet seems a bit awkward to me.</td>', 'nice, but missing the middle/bottom porton of this faucet seems a bit awkward to me.', '2003-12-20 00:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(518173, 50895, 15057, '<td valign="top">This photo is fabulous!</td>', 'This photo is fabulous!', '2003-12-20 01:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(518175, 50846, 15057, '<td valign="top">Ingenious!</td>', 'Ingenious!', '2003-12-20 01:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(518191, 50737, 3306, '<td valign="top">simple and attractive. Good capture. Nicely balanced and focused. I t all works very well.</td>', 'simple and attractive. Good capture. Nicely balanced and focused. I t all works very well.', '2003-12-20 02:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(518192, 50904, 3306, '<td valign="top">I have attempted this shot as well. It is not easy to make it look interesting. Lighting is difficult.</td>', 'I have attempted this shot as well. It is not easy to make it look interesting. Lighting is difficult.', '2003-12-20 02:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(518198, 50400, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is so crisp and clean. The detail in the drops of water is phenomenal. My only negative comment on this, knowing it will show my ignorance.  I do not know what it is! So, it lacks a little interest for me. I am still rating this quite high, I still think of and clearly see "water" as I view this.    9</td>', 'This is so crisp and clean. The detail in the drops of water is phenomenal. My only negative comment on this, knowing it will show my ignorance.  I do not know what it is! So, it lacks a little interest for me. I am still rating this quite high, I still think of and clearly see "water" as I view this.    9', '2003-12-20 03:03:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(518203, 50409, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape. From the looks of this over-all, I think it''s quite good in many ways. I hesitate to share my opinion on this simply because I''m sure it is as you want it to be, and it is good.<br/>My preference would be to add just a little more contrast to help with the dark snow on the bottom, and to add a little more saturation to make the sky brilliant so it isn''t just another sunset. I''m giving this a 7, which is a pretty good score. The overall shot just looks a little flat to me. I do love the composition.<br/></td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape. From the looks of this over-all, I think it''s quite good in many ways. I hesitate to share my opinion on this simply because I''m sure it is as you want it to be, and it is good.My preference would be to add just a little more contrast to help with the dark snow on the bottom, and to add a little more saturation to make the sky brilliant so it isn''t just another sunset. I''m giving this a 7, which is a pretty good score. The overall shot just looks a little flat to me. I do love the composition.', '2003-12-20 03:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(518215, 50678, 13749, '<td valign="top">i like youyr approach, but would''ve liked it a little more if the juice on the side of the glass (at top) was cleaned up before taking this shot.</td>', 'i like youyr approach, but would''ve liked it a little more if the juice on the side of the glass (at top) was cleaned up before taking this shot.', '2003-12-20 04:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(518235, 50889, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I like how your eyes are lead through the curves of the river/creek. Depth of field is good. I like the contrast in the vegetation in the foreground and the background is almost like a painting.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I like how your eyes are lead through the curves of the river/creek. Depth of field is good. I like the contrast in the vegetation in the foreground and the background is almost like a painting.', '2003-12-20 06:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(518237, 50661, 10084, '<td valign="top">The sephia does give the shot a moody feeling. Highlights in the water gives it some interest.</td>', 'The sephia does give the shot a moody feeling. Highlights in the water gives it some interest.', '2003-12-20 06:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(518238, 50734, 10084, '<td valign="top">Image is very interesting. Colors in the water is wonderful. Background frames the composition very nicely. Unfortunately this looks overprocessed.</td>', 'Image is very interesting. Colors in the water is wonderful. Background frames the composition very nicely. Unfortunately this looks overprocessed.', '2003-12-20 06:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(518239, 50668, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good contrast of the green grass, the rocks , and  the muddy water. The stone in the water gives it some added interest.</td>', 'Good contrast of the green grass, the rocks , and  the muddy water. The stone in the water gives it some added interest.', '2003-12-20 06:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(518240, 50828, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus. The depth of field is incredible. I like the details in the wood grain. Great reflections in the icicle.</td>', 'Beautiful focus. The depth of field is incredible. I like the details in the wood grain. Great reflections in the icicle.', '2003-12-20 06:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(518241, 50891, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. The colors are varied and deeply satuarated. I like how your eyes are lead throught the channel. The depth of field is excellent.</td>', 'Very good composition. The colors are varied and deeply satuarated. I like how your eyes are lead throught the channel. The depth of field is excellent.', '2003-12-20 06:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(518321, 50698, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the black and orange, but the black lines look a bit unnatural. Altogether, the composition is interesting- but the background seems a bit too digitally blurred.</td>', 'I love the black and orange, but the black lines look a bit unnatural. Altogether, the composition is interesting- but the background seems a bit too digitally blurred.', '2003-12-20 09:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(518322, 50675, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the blue seems a little too primary. I like the inclusion of the weeds, and perhaps that mountain in the back needs a bit more definition/ needs to be darker.</td>', 'Nice shot but the blue seems a little too primary. I like the inclusion of the weeds, and perhaps that mountain in the back needs a bit more definition/ needs to be darker.', '2003-12-20 09:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(518324, 50894, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. the bleow part of the vase, the starry spotted white part is distracting- but I like how the background is a perfect black.</td>', 'Very interesting. the bleow part of the vase, the starry spotted white part is distracting- but I like how the background is a perfect black.', '2003-12-20 09:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(518325, 50734, 12611, '<td valign="top">THis looks a bit too much like digital art to me. the colors are over equalized and there is an unnatural look to the drops and the edges of the water. Nice creative shot and title, though./</td>', 'THis looks a bit too much like digital art to me. the colors are over equalized and there is an unnatural look to the drops and the edges of the water. Nice creative shot and title, though./', '2003-12-20 09:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(518327, 50660, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Beautiful colors and great negative space. Maybe a little too much water below or it would be a ten+ I would say if there were clouds relfected in the water below you could leave that much- but hell its a great shot- you have my vote for a ribbon.</td>', 'I love this shot. Beautiful colors and great negative space. Maybe a little too much water below or it would be a ten+ I would say if there were clouds relfected in the water below you could leave that much- but hell its a great shot- you have my vote for a ribbon.', '2003-12-20 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(518329, 50598, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very nice blue sky color. You have really conveyed the beauty of the shot nicely.</td>', 'Very nice blue sky color. You have really conveyed the beauty of the shot nicely.', '2003-12-20 10:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(518332, 50891, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great colors and midnight blue water. The clay and salt colors of the stone really create a stark feeling about the shot. There is a somewhat excessive amount of water in the foreground when the most interesting parts seem to disappear up out of the shot- but given the title it works fine.</td>', 'Great colors and midnight blue water. The clay and salt colors of the stone really create a stark feeling about the shot. There is a somewhat excessive amount of water in the foreground when the most interesting parts seem to disappear up out of the shot- but given the title it works fine.', '2003-12-20 10:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(518335, 50621, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of the rim of the glass here. I''m not sure I''m feeling the whole read glass bead reflected as a brownish lump in the glass.</td>', 'I like the clarity of the rim of the glass here. I''m not sure I''m feeling the whole read glass bead reflected as a brownish lump in the glass.', '2003-12-20 10:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(518341, 50737, 12611, '<td valign="top">The red looks a bit unnatural here. I love the colors but youve got jaggies. This is a really good composition though.</td>', 'The red looks a bit unnatural here. I love the colors but youve got jaggies. This is a really good composition though.', '2003-12-20 10:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(518343, 50905, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the slight curve in the stream- the picture is technically good but compositionally a bit too symmetrical. Where the light is is perfect though.</td>', 'I like the slight curve in the stream- the picture is technically good but compositionally a bit too symmetrical. Where the light is is perfect though.', '2003-12-20 10:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(518346, 50745, 12611, '<td valign="top">THe shot quality is a bit lacking- the focus is off? but not off enought o be soft.</td>', 'THe shot quality is a bit lacking- the focus is off? but not off enought o be soft.', '2003-12-20 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(518347, 50847, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Cool shapes and I love the abstract nature of the shot.</td>', 'I like this one. Cool shapes and I love the abstract nature of the shot.', '2003-12-20 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(518349, 50768, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great composition- colors are a tad undersaturated for my taste.</td>', 'Great composition- colors are a tad undersaturated for my taste.', '2003-12-20 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(518351, 50808, 12611, '<td valign="top">Birches are a great tree. Nice try here. Could be more in focus and less sharp.</td>', 'Birches are a great tree. Nice try here. Could be more in focus and less sharp.', '2003-12-20 10:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
