(518364, 50743, 12611, '<td valign="top">There is a scratch on th eleft side of the shot. The focus is interesting and the black and gold really works.</td>', 'There is a scratch on th eleft side of the shot. The focus is interesting and the black and gold really works.', '2003-12-20 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(518418, 50864, 15171, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Well defined image, nice color rendering. The shutter speed /exposure combo is sopt on.</td>', 'Excellent. Well defined image, nice color rendering. The shutter speed /exposure combo is sopt on.', '2003-12-20 12:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(518450, 50797, 7106, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. The lighting is really good. I don''t like how close together the lines are on the background (makes it kind of hard to look at), but if they were farther apart it wouldn''t look as good in the vase.</td>', 'Creative idea. The lighting is really good. I don''t like how close together the lines are on the background (makes it kind of hard to look at), but if they were farther apart it wouldn''t look as good in the vase.', '2003-12-20 12:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(518454, 50087, 7106, '<td valign="top">The falling water looks surreal. Good capture</td>', 'The falling water looks surreal. Good capture', '2003-12-20 12:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518455, 50812, 7106, '<td valign="top">The water looks plesant. I would have cropped out more of the sky, because the sky is hard to photograph w/ out it becoming so overexposed.</td>', 'The water looks plesant. I would have cropped out more of the sky, because the sky is hard to photograph w/ out it becoming so overexposed.', '2003-12-20 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(518456, 50675, 7106, '<td valign="top">It looks very plesant. I like how you were able to get the color of the sky and the color of the water with out either being overexpoused.</td>', 'It looks very plesant. I like how you were able to get the color of the sky and the color of the water with out either being overexpoused.', '2003-12-20 12:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(518457, 50829, 7106, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty harsh on the bottle, and would have looked better if it was diffused and then lit or bounced on the other side to get rid of the shadow.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty harsh on the bottle, and would have looked better if it was diffused and then lit or bounced on the other side to get rid of the shadow.', '2003-12-20 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(518458, 50734, 7106, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharply focused. The shadow of the water is distracting to me, but everyone else might love it ;). Nice photo.</td>', 'Very clear and sharply focused. The shadow of the water is distracting to me, but everyone else might love it ;). Nice photo.', '2003-12-20 12:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(518462, 50725, 7106, '<td valign="top">a waterdrop into this just doesn''t make much sense to me. I can''t tell if this is from throwing a coin into the water, or just a waterdrop.</td>', 'a waterdrop into this just doesn''t make much sense to me. I can''t tell if this is from throwing a coin into the water, or just a waterdrop.', '2003-12-20 13:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(518463, 50864, 7106, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.</td>', 'Nice focus.', '2003-12-20 13:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(518465, 50902, 7106, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting, gives it a nice effect.</td>', 'interesting lighting, gives it a nice effect.', '2003-12-20 13:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(518468, 50660, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool... the water looks like marble or something and simple (but bold) few colors look awesome together.  Excellent!</td>', 'Very cool... the water looks like marble or something and simple (but bold) few colors look awesome together.  Excellent!', '2003-12-20 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(518469, 50724, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow you really dodged and burned this one... looks good.  But the problem is:  The "burned" rocks are totally dominant in the picture, and not the WATER.  :)  I would have also cropped out a little more of the unneeded white area.</td>', 'Wow you really dodged and burned this one... looks good.  But the problem is:  The "burned" rocks are totally dominant in the picture, and not the WATER.  :)  I would have also cropped out a little more of the unneeded white area.', '2003-12-20 13:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(518471, 50611, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  DId you try a portrait perspective also?  This would get more of the water in the frame.  Basically the portrait shot would  remove 1/3 of the right of this picture.  Picture that!</td>', 'Very nice.  DId you try a portrait perspective also?  This would get more of the water in the frame.  Basically the portrait shot would  remove 1/3 of the right of this picture.  Picture that!', '2003-12-20 13:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(518473, 50042, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit challenge no matter how hard you tried with the Title. :)  The grapes are just to dominant.  But I love the shot.  The snow goes great with the dark grapes.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit challenge no matter how hard you tried with the Title. :)  The grapes are just to dominant.  But I love the shot.  The snow goes great with the dark grapes.', '2003-12-20 13:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(518475, 50841, 4494, '<td valign="top">Too many reeds in the shot.   This shot could be great in a portriat orientation (to go with the length of the reeds), and then zoom in only about 1/4 of what is currently there.  When you find things like this to shoot, don''t be afraid to take 10 or 20 shots from all different angles, zooms, and orientations.  Get a bigger CF memory card if you have to! :)</td>', 'Too many reeds in the shot.   This shot could be great in a portriat orientation (to go with the length of the reeds), and then zoom in only about 1/4 of what is currently there.  When you find things like this to shoot, don''t be afraid to take 10 or 20 shots from all different angles, zooms, and orientations.  Get a bigger CF memory card if you have to! :)', '2003-12-20 13:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(518481, 50678, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely and good.</td>', 'Lovely and good.', '2003-12-20 13:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(518483, 50551, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2003-12-20 13:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(518485, 50835, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2003-12-20 13:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(518486, 50901, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely and I like it very much.</td>', 'Lovely and I like it very much.', '2003-12-20 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(518488, 50549, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beatiful tones and I love the capture here.  IMHO this shot has to much of something though.  Cropping with my hands on the screen, if you get rid of some of the bottom (water) and go down from the gap in the center of the geese to the left OR right you end up with a much cleaner composition.  This shot is both a little empty (too much negative space that doesn\''t seem to add IMHO) and busy at the same time.<br/>TC</td>', 'Beatiful tones and I love the capture here.  IMHO this shot has to much of something though.  Cropping with my hands on the screen, if you get rid of some of the bottom (water) and go down from the gap in the center of the geese to the left OR right you end up with a much cleaner composition.  This shot is both a little empty (too much negative space that doesn\''t seem to add IMHO) and busy at the same time.TC', '2003-12-20 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(518490, 50896, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty scene, but is a bit too contrasty.  It looks like a very relaxing place, but the feeling of the shot is unrestful.  You go from too dark to too light.  Maybe play with levels a little more?  I like the red tones against the blue.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very pretty scene, but is a bit too contrasty.  It looks like a very relaxing place, but the feeling of the shot is unrestful.  You go from too dark to too light.  Maybe play with levels a little more?  I like the red tones against the blue.TC', '2003-12-20 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(518500, 50860, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks too photoshoped for my tastes.<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks too photoshoped for my tastes.TC', '2003-12-20 14:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518502, 50798, 9906, '<td valign="top">The colors here are way dull.  I like the composition but you need way more light.  The water fall seems very regular.  Is that a fountain?<br/>TC</td>', 'The colors here are way dull.  I like the composition but you need way more light.  The water fall seems very regular.  Is that a fountain?TC', '2003-12-20 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(518503, 50728, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this one.</td>', 'Nice colors in this one.', '2003-12-20 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(518510, 50746, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is awesome.  This looks so "real" like I''m standing right there with my feet in the water.  Excellent, keeping everything in focus.  The only thing I''d recommend is you should have cloned out the tan stick in the upper-left.  It sticks out like a "sore thumb".  Great anyway.  8.</td>', 'Wow, this is awesome.  This looks so "real" like I''m standing right there with my feet in the water.  Excellent, keeping everything in focus.  The only thing I''d recommend is you should have cloned out the tan stick in the upper-left.  It sticks out like a "sore thumb".  Great anyway.  8.', '2003-12-20 14:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(518512, 50867, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, never seen anything like this before.  Good job!</td>', 'Pretty cool, never seen anything like this before.  Good job!', '2003-12-20 14:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(518514, 50793, 4494, '<td valign="top">It\''s great, but where is the water?   I realize that clouds are made up of water but... :)  Otherwise, it\''s a very interesting pic... I like it.</td>', 'It\''s great, but where is the water?   I realize that clouds are made up of water but... :)  Otherwise, it\''s a very interesting pic... I like it.', '2003-12-20 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(518516, 50818, 4494, '<td valign="top">It looks hot to me not cold.  Really cool, I love the abstractness and colors.</td>', 'It looks hot to me not cold.  Really cool, I love the abstractness and colors.', '2003-12-20 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(518517, 50829, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too photoshopped, not straight, un-interesting...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too photoshopped, not straight, un-interesting...TC', '2003-12-20 14:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(518518, 50886, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very creative!!!  And well done, you timed it perfectly!  Great lighting also, good job.  8.</td>', 'Very creative!!!  And well done, you timed it perfectly!  Great lighting also, good job.  8.', '2003-12-20 14:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(518519, 50889, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting, and one of the better "landscape" shots.  Excellent I realllllly like it.  8.</td>', 'Looks like a painting, and one of the better "landscape" shots.  Excellent I realllllly like it.  8.', '2003-12-20 14:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(518521, 50830, 4494, '<td valign="top">Colors are terrible.  Can''t really tell what I''m looking at because the details are so distorted by the color.</td>', 'Colors are terrible.  Can''t really tell what I''m looking at because the details are so distorted by the color.', '2003-12-20 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
