(518523, 50631, 9906, '<td valign="top">Something seems not really right about this shot but I don''t know what exactly.  I think it''s the lighting on the wave.  Don''t live by this much water, so I don''t have any potential solutions, just the gut feeling that there is something improvable...<br/>TC</td>', 'Something seems not really right about this shot but I don''t know what exactly.  I think it''s the lighting on the wave.  Don''t live by this much water, so I don''t have any potential solutions, just the gut feeling that there is something improvable...TC', '2003-12-20 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(518524, 50179, 4494, '<td valign="top">Would be even better without that big log there...  guess that is a little too much to clone out, huh? :D    Nice shot the white snow and gray water go well together.</td>', 'Would be even better without that big log there...  guess that is a little too much to clone out, huh? :D    Nice shot the white snow and gray water go well together.', '2003-12-20 14:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
