(518526, 50732, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s out of focus and the water is almost impossible to see.  You should have used different lighting... the candle isn''t strong enought to light everything and all you see is the flame.</td>', 'It''s out of focus and the water is almost impossible to see.  You should have used different lighting... the candle isn''t strong enought to light everything and all you see is the flame.', '2003-12-20 14:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(518527, 50842, 9906, '<td valign="top">This IMHO is too post edited.  I don''t really go for the psychedelic look.  Cut back on the saturation a touch then maybe...<br/>TC</td>', 'This IMHO is too post edited.  I don''t really go for the psychedelic look.  Cut back on the saturation a touch then maybe...TC', '2003-12-20 14:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(518528, 50863, 4494, '<td valign="top">Needs more light.</td>', 'Needs more light.', '2003-12-20 14:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(518529, 50661, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but you don''t have enough contrasts to make the two tone treatment work well.  You lose too much detail in the two subjects.  I love the look on the childs face.  Priceless!  Nice almost there shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely composed, but you don''t have enough contrasts to make the two tone treatment work well.  You lose too much detail in the two subjects.  I love the look on the childs face.  Priceless!  Nice almost there shot!TC', '2003-12-20 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(518530, 50737, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  I LOVE THIS ONE!   I really like shots like this with 3 or 4 BOLD colors that fit well together.  Just this fact, makes a normally boring picture/subject into a fantastic image like this one.   Great!! 9.<br/></td>', 'Wow!!!  I LOVE THIS ONE!   I really like shots like this with 3 or 4 BOLD colors that fit well together.  Just this fact, makes a normally boring picture/subject into a fantastic image like this one.   Great!! 9.', '2003-12-20 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(518532, 50135, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is crooked and a little busy.  Boy and foreground ducks would make a cleaner presentation.  Crooked part is easy to fix in photoshop if you have a good vertical or horizontal reference in the shot (the reeds maybe).<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is crooked and a little busy.  Boy and foreground ducks would make a cleaner presentation.  Crooked part is easy to fix in photoshop if you have a good vertical or horizontal reference in the shot (the reeds maybe).TC', '2003-12-20 14:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
