(518538, 50598, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat.</td>', 'Pretty neat.', '2003-12-20 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(518539, 50496, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Great job isolating the splash with the black behind it.  The blue tint also gives a sense of "torture" or pain a little too.  8.</td>', 'LOL.  Great job isolating the splash with the black behind it.  The blue tint also gives a sense of "torture" or pain a little too.  8.', '2003-12-20 14:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(518541, 50890, 4494, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this they way the spigot looks like it''s broken down into seperate pieces.  To bad you couldn''t get the drop a little bigger or when it was just about to fall.  Great job.  8.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this they way the spigot looks like it''s broken down into seperate pieces.  To bad you couldn''t get the drop a little bigger or when it was just about to fall.  Great job.  8.', '2003-12-20 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(518566, 50611, 14369, '<td valign="top">Love the silky look of the water. I''d like to know what type of filters, speed, etc. was used in this photo. I would like to try the same, but camera shop said I need an ND400 or better for getting this type of effect. If you need to...please email more specifics. Again....wonderful photo. I think this is one of the best, if not THE best, in the water challenge.</td>', 'Love the silky look of the water. I''d like to know what type of filters, speed, etc. was used in this photo. I would like to try the same, but camera shop said I need an ND400 or better for getting this type of effect. If you need to...please email more specifics. Again....wonderful photo. I think this is one of the best, if not THE best, in the water challenge.', '2003-12-20 16:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518567, 50818, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and textures! Marvelous abstract! 9</td>', 'Lovely colors and textures! Marvelous abstract! 9', '2003-12-20 16:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(518569, 50873, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action photography here. B/W heightens the focus on the forms and textures.</td>', 'Nice stop-action photography here. B/W heightens the focus on the forms and textures.', '2003-12-20 16:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(518571, 50541, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks good. Are these grapes? Try dipping grapes into melted white chocolate, and then freezing them. Serve them in a strong, berry flavored juice. Yum! The lighting is just a bit harsh here, but most of the ice crystals are sharp and clear.</td>', 'Looks good. Are these grapes? Try dipping grapes into melted white chocolate, and then freezing them. Serve them in a strong, berry flavored juice. Yum! The lighting is just a bit harsh here, but most of the ice crystals are sharp and clear.', '2003-12-20 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(518572, 50835, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the icy film texture. Composition is strong and details are very interesting. Nice work!</td>', 'Nice capture of the icy film texture. Composition is strong and details are very interesting. Nice work!', '2003-12-20 16:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(518573, 50674, 6870, '<td valign="top">Symmetry works well here to give this image a stately appearance. Lighting is engaging and welcoming. I like!</td>', 'Symmetry works well here to give this image a stately appearance. Lighting is engaging and welcoming. I like!', '2003-12-20 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(518575, 50850, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce depth of field here. I like the very blurry background. I wish more of the icicle were more in focus, though. Composition is very strong.</td>', 'NIce depth of field here. I like the very blurry background. I wish more of the icicle were more in focus, though. Composition is very strong.', '2003-12-20 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(518576, 50812, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bit too light, perhaps, but composition is very balanced, and the scene is lovely. Nice tones on the background and buliding.</td>', 'A bit too light, perhaps, but composition is very balanced, and the scene is lovely. Nice tones on the background and buliding.', '2003-12-20 16:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(518577, 50897, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! That little star is just the right touch! Super depth of field. Perhaps oversharpened or something? There seems to be some digital noise around your edges. Nice work!</td>', 'Fun shot! That little star is just the right touch! Super depth of field. Perhaps oversharpened or something? There seems to be some digital noise around your edges. Nice work!', '2003-12-20 16:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(518578, 50847, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterns reveal your good eye for seeing the engaging among the mundane.</td>', 'Interesting patterns reveal your good eye for seeing the engaging among the mundane.', '2003-12-20 16:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(518580, 50744, 6870, '<td valign="top">Composition is strong and abstract. I like it and its mood. I do wish more were in focus,though.</td>', 'Composition is strong and abstract. I like it and its mood. I do wish more were in focus,though.', '2003-12-20 16:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(518581, 50384, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interestingly, the focus is not on the water, but on the lights and trees and windows. However, since water takes up so much of the image, it feels wet. In any event, you capture a nice balance here, and it definitely meets the challenge--but through a back door.</td>', 'Interestingly, the focus is not on the water, but on the lights and trees and windows. However, since water takes up so much of the image, it feels wet. In any event, you capture a nice balance here, and it definitely meets the challenge--but through a back door.', '2003-12-20 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(518582, 50842, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a tad too dark, but I''m inclined to go darker to get these marvelous colors and tones. Nice composition.</td>', 'Perhaps just a tad too dark, but I''m inclined to go darker to get these marvelous colors and tones. Nice composition.', '2003-12-20 16:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(518585, 50839, 6870, '<td valign="top">When my friend was a kid, he had a goldfish as a pet. He would take it out if it''s tank and ''pet'' it every night. Every day, the fish would be dead when he went off to school, and his mom would replace it with a goldfish from the store! This went on for several weeks. It has nothing to do with your image, though, except that it concerns a goldfish! Your shot?" I like the clarity of the water here, and your fish is nicely in focus. I think having the rocks in focus, too, was a good idea. Have you experimented with this fish being off center or on a ''third?''</td>', 'When my friend was a kid, he had a goldfish as a pet. He would take it out if it''s tank and ''pet'' it every night. Every day, the fish would be dead when he went off to school, and his mom would replace it with a goldfish from the store! This went on for several weeks. It has nothing to do with your image, though, except that it concerns a goldfish! Your shot?" I like the clarity of the water here, and your fish is nicely in focus. I think having the rocks in focus, too, was a good idea. Have you experimented with this fish being off center or on a ''third?''', '2003-12-20 16:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(518587, 50625, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action photo, here. The composition is very strong, with those curves and tones creating interest.</td>', 'Nice stop action photo, here. The composition is very strong, with those curves and tones creating interest.', '2003-12-20 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(518590, 50809, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice use of snow to ''frame'' your water. Colors are clear and saturated. You managed to retain detail in the snow, too.</td>', 'Nice use of snow to ''frame'' your water. Colors are clear and saturated. You managed to retain detail in the snow, too.', '2003-12-20 16:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(518591, 50902, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing close up! I like the depth of field used, and the slightly off balance composition draws my attention more to the little drip.</td>', 'Very intriguing close up! I like the depth of field used, and the slightly off balance composition draws my attention more to the little drip.', '2003-12-20 16:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(518592, 50888, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely. An elegant shot! 9</td>', 'Simple and lovely. An elegant shot! 9', '2003-12-20 16:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(518594, 50864, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tones and colors are so clear and interesting. Nice work.</td>', 'Tones and colors are so clear and interesting. Nice work.', '2003-12-20 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(518599, 50852, 6870, '<td valign="top">Where are you finding iris this time of year? Lovely shot. Lighting is just right. It doesn''t draw attention to itself, but still manages to give shape and form to the bloom and water drops.</td>', 'Where are you finding iris this time of year? Lovely shot. Lighting is just right. It doesn''t draw attention to itself, but still manages to give shape and form to the bloom and water drops.', '2003-12-20 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(518679, 50042, 6870, '<td valign="top">The grapes are well exposed. The snow almost glows. Interesting effect. Composition is balanced and strong.</td>', 'The grapes are well exposed. The snow almost glows. Interesting effect. Composition is balanced and strong.', '2003-12-20 19:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(518680, 50631, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple, lovely surf shot. Very nice work!</td>', 'Simple, lovely surf shot. Very nice work!', '2003-12-20 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
