(518683, 50891, 6870, '<td valign="top">You must be out here in the west! Hopefully it will rain soon. I like how the focus is right on the waterline. Had you considered boosting the saturation a little? This may add to the impact of the photo.</td>', 'You must be out here in the west! Hopefully it will rain soon. I like how the focus is right on the waterline. Had you considered boosting the saturation a little? This may add to the impact of the photo.', '2003-12-20 19:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
