(518815, 50839, 11078, '<td valign="top">looks a bit static, nice colours, but it doesnt give much impression of water</td>', 'looks a bit static, nice colours, but it doesnt give much impression of water', '2003-12-21 01:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(518816, 50438, 11078, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2003-12-21 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(518819, 50567, 7291, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorits so far.  Good use of black &amp; white.  - 10</td>', 'I think this is my favorits so far.  Good use of black & white.  - 10', '2003-12-21 01:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(518852, 50409, 3121, '<td valign="top">amaizing</td>', 'amaizing', '2003-12-21 03:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(518857, 50678, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and highlights in the bubbles. Composition is very interesting. Kind of wished that that the colors were a bit more vibrant, but definitely a great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and highlights in the bubbles. Composition is very interesting. Kind of wished that that the colors were a bit more vibrant, but definitely a great shot.', '2003-12-21 04:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(518859, 50732, 10084, '<td valign="top">Needmore highlights in the glass to really make it pop out of the shot. The shadow behind the glass is fairly interesting.</td>', 'Needmore highlights in the glass to really make it pop out of the shot. The shadow behind the glass is fairly interesting.', '2003-12-21 04:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(518862, 50892, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a snowflake. The black background frames this very well and helps it pop out of the shot. The intricate design of the snow is highlighted by the wonder lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a snowflake. The black background frames this very well and helps it pop out of the shot. The intricate design of the snow is highlighted by the wonder lighting.', '2003-12-21 04:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(518864, 50791, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the highlights in the bubbles. They''re  almost hypnotic. Water ripples on the top of the shot is really nice. What is that ball object?</td>', 'I like the highlights in the bubbles. They''re  almost hypnotic. Water ripples on the top of the shot is really nice. What is that ball object?', '2003-12-21 04:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(518865, 50842, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looks like an autumn scene from another planet. The reflections in the water has some beautiful colors.</td>', 'Looks like an autumn scene from another planet. The reflections in the water has some beautiful colors.', '2003-12-21 05:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(518866, 50051, 10084, '<td valign="top">The water ripples are very nice. Highlights and shadows in the ripples were captured perfectly. The contrast of black and white helps the composition stay interesting.</td>', 'The water ripples are very nice. Highlights and shadows in the ripples were captured perfectly. The contrast of black and white helps the composition stay interesting.', '2003-12-21 05:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(518867, 50894, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful lighting. The purple is very vibrant. I like the highlights and reflections of the lights from the bubbles and foam. The black background really helps to make the subject pop out of the picture.</td>', 'Very beautiful lighting. The purple is very vibrant. I like the highlights and reflections of the lights from the bubbles and foam. The black background really helps to make the subject pop out of the picture.', '2003-12-21 05:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(518868, 50818, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice vibrant contrasting colors. The bubbles are very interesting. This looks like a microscope view of cells. Can''t wait to find out how you did this.</td>', 'Very nice vibrant contrasting colors. The bubbles are very interesting. This looks like a microscope view of cells. Can''t wait to find out how you did this.', '2003-12-21 05:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(518876, 50833, 12611, '<td valign="top">very nice- here''s a hint from helouise- if you use hot water-you get clear cubes. Nice blue glow</td>', 'very nice- here''s a hint from helouise- if you use hot water-you get clear cubes. Nice blue glow', '2003-12-21 08:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(518877, 50428, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like It. Very nice- it could be sharper but the composition is really great.</td>', 'I like It. Very nice- it could be sharper but the composition is really great.', '2003-12-21 08:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(518879, 50551, 12611, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it but I love it.The yellow is fantastic.</td>', 'I don''t get it but I love it.The yellow is fantastic.', '2003-12-21 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(518885, 50849, 11738, '<td valign="top">I know firsthand how small these guys are.  Good job.</td>', 'I know firsthand how small these guys are.  Good job.', '2003-12-21 08:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(518886, 50895, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, the texture and lighting is brilliant. 10</td>', 'I love this photo, the texture and lighting is brilliant. 10', '2003-12-21 08:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(518887, 50839, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think a less centered composition would have worked better here, and maybe a background which wasnt so similar in colour to the fish.</td>', 'I think a less centered composition would have worked better here, and maybe a background which wasnt so similar in colour to the fish.', '2003-12-21 08:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(518889, 50791, 2780, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit too busy for my tastes, but its still a nice capture.  Perhaps colourising it to a nice blue colour would make it look better?</td>', 'It looks a bit too busy for my tastes, but its still a nice capture.  Perhaps colourising it to a nice blue colour would make it look better?', '2003-12-21 08:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(518890, 50674, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition and capture of tones. 9</td>', 'Really nice composition and capture of tones. 9', '2003-12-21 08:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(518891, 50042, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the white areas seem a little too bright for my taste.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the white areas seem a little too bright for my taste.', '2003-12-21 08:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(518892, 50737, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, altho I''m not too keen on the background colour. 8</td>', 'Nice photo, altho I''m not too keen on the background colour. 8', '2003-12-21 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(518893, 50721, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the middle line being so centered. Being on the 3rd line would have improved it I think.</td>', 'I don''t really like the middle line being so centered. Being on the 3rd line would have improved it I think.', '2003-12-21 08:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(518894, 50567, 1128, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone choice you have made-- it really fits the photo.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like the tone choice you have made-- it really fits the photo.  Nicely done!', '2003-12-21 08:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(518895, 50631, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I''m not sure how I would improve it, but the colours just seem a little flat. 8</td>', 'Very nice photo. I''m not sure how I would improve it, but the colours just seem a little flat. 8', '2003-12-21 08:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(518898, 50870, 1128, '<td valign="top">You did a great job balancing out the areas of dark and light, which seems hard to do in this photo.</td>', 'You did a great job balancing out the areas of dark and light, which seems hard to do in this photo.', '2003-12-21 09:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(518899, 50722, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what this is supposed to be... some kind of neopet? I think it''s a little too distorted, and seems too flat in my opinion.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what this is supposed to be... some kind of neopet? I think it''s a little too distorted, and seems too flat in my opinion.', '2003-12-21 09:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(518900, 50721, 1128, '<td valign="top">You might want to bump up the saturation a little in this photo, the colors seem a little washed out.</td>', 'You might want to bump up the saturation a little in this photo, the colors seem a little washed out.', '2003-12-21 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(518901, 50549, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I''m not sure if it was possible with your camera, but zooming in a bit more would have been even better.</td>', 'Nice capture, I''m not sure if it was possible with your camera, but zooming in a bit more would have been even better.', '2003-12-21 09:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(518902, 50621, 1128, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little off here, espcially on the glass beads.  I like the lighting.</td>', 'The focus seems a little off here, espcially on the glass beads.  I like the lighting.', '2003-12-21 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
