(519319, 50903, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle nature of this image... simplicity... the texture of the surface and the contrast provided by the water drops...</td>', 'I like the subtle nature of this image... simplicity... the texture of the surface and the contrast provided by the water drops...', '2003-12-21 22:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
