(519322, 50813, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the way the people in this scene give a strong context to the vastness of this particular landscape.  It creates perspective...</td>', 'I like the way the people in this scene give a strong context to the vastness of this particular landscape.  It creates perspective...', '2003-12-21 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(519324, 50725, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a well done shot but there are two things that bother me about it... it seems that the color saturation is a bit heavy.  The contrast underneat the water draws my attention moreso than the column of water from the droplet...</td>', 'I think this is a well done shot but there are two things that bother me about it... it seems that the color saturation is a bit heavy.  The contrast underneat the water draws my attention moreso than the column of water from the droplet...', '2003-12-21 22:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(519325, 50704, 772, '<td valign="top">nice theme here.... maybe slightly underexposed...</td>', 'nice theme here.... maybe slightly underexposed...', '2003-12-21 22:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(519327, 50871, 772, '<td valign="top">nice exposure... maybe a bit lacking in a focal point...</td>', 'nice exposure... maybe a bit lacking in a focal point...', '2003-12-21 22:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(519328, 50888, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... simplicity :)  great shot...</td>', 'excellent work... simplicity :)  great shot...', '2003-12-21 22:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(519330, 50828, 772, '<td valign="top">maybe a tad out of focus, but the seemless background with the shallow depth of field works nicely here...</td>', 'maybe a tad out of focus, but the seemless background with the shallow depth of field works nicely here...', '2003-12-21 22:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(519331, 50797, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting theme... this image is actually a bit of a strain to look at :)</td>', 'interesting theme... this image is actually a bit of a strain to look at :)', '2003-12-21 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(519333, 50664, 772, '<td valign="top">lovely abstract... i love the way water distorts reality :)</td>', 'lovely abstract... i love the way water distorts reality :)', '2003-12-21 22:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(519334, 50611, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful scene, but the ''muddy'' area of the water seems a bit unnatural... not sure what is causing that but I would definitely continue to work this cascade with your camera :)</td>', 'beautiful scene, but the ''muddy'' area of the water seems a bit unnatural... not sure what is causing that but I would definitely continue to work this cascade with your camera :)', '2003-12-21 22:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(519336, 50541, 772, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a bit harsh... not sure how you could fix that.. maybe a light source other than the camera flash and bring the light in from an angle...</td>', 'the lighting is a bit harsh... not sure how you could fix that.. maybe a light source other than the camera flash and bring the light in from an angle...', '2003-12-21 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(519345, 50852, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, I really like the subtle yellow border with this shot.  Nice work. 10</td>', 'Beautiful colors, I really like the subtle yellow border with this shot.  Nice work. 10', '2003-12-21 22:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(519348, 50763, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depth of field was captured. Hightlights and reflections in the subject really helps it pop out of the shot. I like the water that is dripping down the mouth. Very nice capture. I would like to see more of the spraying water. Just seems abruptly cut off.</td>', 'Beautiful depth of field was captured. Hightlights and reflections in the subject really helps it pop out of the shot. I like the water that is dripping down the mouth. Very nice capture. I would like to see more of the spraying water. Just seems abruptly cut off.', '2003-12-21 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(519349, 50547, 10084, '<td valign="top">The umbrella is set up in a nice and interesting composition. The contrast is great and helps to add a graphic dynamic to the shot.</td>', 'The umbrella is set up in a nice and interesting composition. The contrast is great and helps to add a graphic dynamic to the shot.', '2003-12-21 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(519352, 50567, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The contrast is absolutely incredible. Really helps to give a strong presence to the rocks and make this breathe taking. I like how the waterfall makes your eyes follow the water from the top toward the bottom of the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The contrast is absolutely incredible. Really helps to give a strong presence to the rocks and make this breathe taking. I like how the waterfall makes your eyes follow the water from the top toward the bottom of the shot.', '2003-12-21 22:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(519355, 50611, 6668, '<td valign="top">Gorgous shot, I love the lines and texture of the water. Stunning! 10</td>', 'Gorgous shot, I love the lines and texture of the water. Stunning! 10', '2003-12-21 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(519358, 50664, 5705, '<td valign="top">This is incredible---  Perfect droplet inside the wire-- couldnt be done any better!<br/>This may spawn clones, like Setz''s Waterdrops!--<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'This is incredible---  Perfect droplet inside the wire-- couldnt be done any better!This may spawn clones, like Setz''s Waterdrops!-- 10', '2003-12-21 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(519374, 50797, 8637, '<td valign="top">Really cool...great idea and well done.  Now I''ve got to go try this.  Glad you resisted putting a border around this too.  Great!</td>', 'Really cool...great idea and well done.  Now I''ve got to go try this.  Glad you resisted putting a border around this too.  Great!', '2003-12-21 22:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(519380, 50698, 9906, '<td valign="top">The water looks very nice, but there are some issues with the rest of the shot.  The black is underexposed, losing all the detail.  The bright white thing (lower right above the black) is very distracting.  You have an odd pattern on the background.  Is it tile?  At first I thought that this might be a moire pattern from a scanner, but not so sure anymore.<br/>TC</td>', 'The water looks very nice, but there are some issues with the rest of the shot.  The black is underexposed, losing all the detail.  The bright white thing (lower right above the black) is very distracting.  You have an odd pattern on the background.  Is it tile?  At first I thought that this might be a moire pattern from a scanner, but not so sure anymore.TC', '2003-12-21 23:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(519385, 50890, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little too low key for my taste.  You lose too uch detail.  I don''t need a whole lot more, just enough to conect everything...<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is a little too low key for my taste.  You lose too uch detail.  I don''t need a whole lot more, just enough to conect everything...TC', '2003-12-21 23:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(519389, 50674, 11895, '<td valign="top">great shot, fits the topic well, has good color and texture, lighting is appropriate for the season, and a unique perspective, my top vote in this challenge, hope you didn''t get your feet wet</td>', 'great shot, fits the topic well, has good color and texture, lighting is appropriate for the season, and a unique perspective, my top vote in this challenge, hope you didn''t get your feet wet', '2003-12-21 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(519390, 50807, 6668, '<td valign="top">Photo seems a bit dark and perhaps a bit grainy to me. 5</td>', 'Photo seems a bit dark and perhaps a bit grainy to me. 5', '2003-12-21 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(519391, 50710, 5112, '<td valign="top">lovely shot!  10 from me.</td>', 'lovely shot!  10 from me.', '2003-12-21 23:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(519392, 50830, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally care for the unatural purple colors in this shot, would have been better in its natural coloring I feel.</td>', 'I don''t personally care for the unatural purple colors in this shot, would have been better in its natural coloring I feel.', '2003-12-21 23:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(519396, 50872, 5112, '<td valign="top">Oskar, after looking at your portfolio, I was wondering if this was your picture.  It\\\\\\\''s good, very good!  Congratulations.  The juxtaposition of the clear little grasses in the snow and the running water, the rocks in the middle, it\\\\\\\''s just right.<br/> <br/>My one gripe, and it\\\\\\\''s a personal thing, is that I don\\\\\\\''t much care for the border.  The picture is too beautiful to need a border that grabs that much attention.  On the other hand, I haven\\\\\\\''t seen it without the border, so it might be better this way :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oskar, after looking at your portfolio, I was wondering if this was your picture.  It\\\\\\\''s good, very good!  Congratulations.  The juxtaposition of the clear little grasses in the snow and the running water, the rocks in the middle, it\\\\\\\''s just right. My one gripe, and it\\\\\\\''s a personal thing, is that I don\\\\\\\''t much care for the border.  The picture is too beautiful to need a border that grabs that much attention.  On the other hand, I haven\\\\\\\''t seen it without the border, so it might be better this way :) ', '2003-12-21 23:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(519398, 50576, 11895, '<td valign="top">excellent photo, fits topic well, would have liked the horizon to be just slightly more defined, border doesn''t add anything</td>', 'excellent photo, fits topic well, would have liked the horizon to be just slightly more defined, border doesn''t add anything', '2003-12-21 23:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(519406, 50889, 7778, '<td valign="top">&gt; 7</td>', '> 7', '2003-12-21 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(519408, 50734, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but it looks "overprocessed" to me. The edges of water look "hard" and not smooth, with a light-blue "streak" on the right side.</td>', 'Nice capture, but it looks "overprocessed" to me. The edges of water look "hard" and not smooth, with a light-blue "streak" on the right side.', '2003-12-21 23:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(519412, 50574, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL..cute!</td>', 'LOL..cute!', '2003-12-21 23:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(519414, 50664, 7778, '<td valign="top">Unique and simple capture with a strong graphic appeal and good composition. Also the most imaginative of the setup shots entered in this challenge, IMO. <br/>The border is a little ostentatious for such a minimal shot, perhaps.</td>', 'Unique and simple capture with a strong graphic appeal and good composition. Also the most imaginative of the setup shots entered in this challenge, IMO. The border is a little ostentatious for such a minimal shot, perhaps.', '2003-12-21 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(519421, 50409, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I love the colors. Nicely done! 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I love the colors. Nicely done! 10', '2003-12-21 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(519423, 50660, 3102, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my top picks -- great work!</td>', 'Definitely one of my top picks -- great work!', '2003-12-21 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(519424, 50872, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week!  Nice &amp; silky -- love it!</td>', 'One of my favorites this week!  Nice & silky -- love it!', '2003-12-21 23:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(519425, 50829, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this one lacks a bit of punch... it just seems like a very uninspired shot of a bottle of water.</td>', 'I''m afraid this one lacks a bit of punch... it just seems like a very uninspired shot of a bottle of water.', '2003-12-21 23:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(519427, 50619, 3102, '<td valign="top">It took me quite a while to recognize what I was seeing in this shot.  Maybe another angle, or perhaps a more dramatic icycle would have been better.</td>', 'It took me quite a while to recognize what I was seeing in this shot.  Maybe another angle, or perhaps a more dramatic icycle would have been better.', '2003-12-21 23:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
