(519827, 50798, 2764, '<td valign="top">What?  Was I the only one who liked this??  Now I wish I had given it a ten instead of a nine.  Could it be a monitor issue??  Since someone said it was dull.  It looks great to me but maybe you should check it on several different monitors.  Sometimes a darkish image suffers from other poeples calibration.</td>', 'What?  Was I the only one who liked this??  Now I wish I had given it a ten instead of a nine.  Could it be a monitor issue??  Since someone said it was dull.  It looks great to me but maybe you should check it on several different monitors.  Sometimes a darkish image suffers from other poeples calibration.', '2003-12-22 09:43:08.000000', NULL, 0),
