(520060, 50839, 10402, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who left comments. One thing I like about this photo is the way the top of the fish blends into the background and seems flat but the bottom is distinctly three-dimensional. And centering the fish seems to accentuate the effect. But it''s nice to know how it is perceived by others, so I really appreciate the comments.</td>', 'Thanks to all who left comments. One thing I like about this photo is the way the top of the fish blends into the background and seems flat but the bottom is distinctly three-dimensional. And centering the fish seems to accentuate the effect. But it''s nice to know how it is perceived by others, so I really appreciate the comments.', '2003-12-22 15:33:43.000000', NULL, 0),
