(523278, 50563, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club :)<br/> <br/>Hi phaedrus...<br/> <br/>That waterfall behind the bridge is quite impressive.  There appears to be a lot of heavy water flow here for obvious reasons.  <br/> <br/>There are a few items that could possibly help improve this photo.  The twigs in the lower left corner are not really adding anything to the composition, so composing a bit differently may help remove those.  The tilt of the bridge also seems to feel slightly awkward.  <br/> <br/>The lack of color in this color image also feels a bit odd.  Maybe the light was not the best at this time of day for this particular photo.  It also looks like there are some excellent photo opportunities from the bridge itself :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club :) Hi phaedrus... That waterfall behind the bridge is quite impressive.  There appears to be a lot of heavy water flow here for obvious reasons.   There are a few items that could possibly help improve this photo.  The twigs in the lower left corner are not really adding anything to the composition, so composing a bit differently may help remove those.  The tilt of the bridge also seems to feel slightly awkward.   The lack of color in this color image also feels a bit odd.  Maybe the light was not the best at this time of day for this particular photo.  It also looks like there are some excellent photo opportunities from the bridge itself :) ', '2003-12-26 11:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
