(523543, 50660, 14812, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection of the buoy and chain in the form of a shadow, rather than a direct mirror image. The picture exudes a certain type of calming emotion. Wonderfully placed at the top, rather than centred for a very unique look. Congratulations on your win :)</td>', 'I really like the reflection of the buoy and chain in the form of a shadow, rather than a direct mirror image. The picture exudes a certain type of calming emotion. Wonderfully placed at the top, rather than centred for a very unique look. Congratulations on your win :)', '2003-12-26 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
