(952077, 50889, 21183, '<td valign="top">Thank you for sharing your photo in the thread about ''mist''. That top 1/3 of your photo (to me) describes the the brink to life, or death.. and light of morn, which bridges night and day and dimensions like those dreamed up for tellers of ghost stories, which are mentioned in the lines of the poem I shared with you.  This particular photo has meandering water leading into the mist and I like the grasses in the foreground.</td>', 'Thank you for sharing your photo in the thread about ''mist''. That top 1/3 of your photo (to me) describes the the brink to life, or death.. and light of morn, which bridges night and day and dimensions like those dreamed up for tellers of ghost stories, which are mentioned in the lines of the poem I shared with you.  This particular photo has meandering water leading into the mist and I like the grasses in the foreground.', '2004-10-09 17:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
